Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:21.76,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,《暮光之城4：破晓（上）》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.97,0:01:10.86,CHS,NTP,0,0,0,,(新娘:伊莎贝拉·玛丽·斯旺 | 新郎:爱德华·安东尼·马森·卡伦)
Dialogue: 1,1:13:14.53,1:13:14.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,(不死身孩子)
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.81,1:13:19.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,(吸血鬼孩子)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.27,0:00:00.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.78,0:00:25.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Childhood is not from birth to a certain age.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:31.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,At a certain age the child is grown and puts away childish things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.90,0:00:42.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Childhood is the kingdom where nobody dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake! Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:24.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Phil!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:30.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.74,0:01:45.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,You just have to break them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:48.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been breaking them in for 3 days.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:50.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can I just go barefoot? - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:52.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.53,0:01:54.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking it's just a little much,you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,The dress and the shoes...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.57,0:01:58.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,All of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:02.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,No,it's exactly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow will be perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where you want'em,boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:08.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,On either side of the aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.34,0:02:11.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What aisle? - Does no one have vision?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,You! Go home and gets lots of beauty sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:33.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.09,0:02:36.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just checking for cold feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:31.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mine are toasty warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not too late to change your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.32,0:03:34.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're having second thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:38.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:43.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've waited a century to marry you,Ms. Swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:48.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.73,0:03:53.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I haven't told you everything about myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? You're not a virgin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:06.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't scare me away now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:12.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,A few years after Carlisle created me,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I rebelled against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I resented him for curbing my appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.38,0:04:21.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,For a while,I went off on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted to know how it felt to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.60,0:04:32.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,To taste human blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,All the men I killed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,were monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:25.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,And so was I.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:32.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Edward,they were all murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.96,0:05:36.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've probably saved more lives than you've took.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.41,0:05:39.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella,that's what I've told myself
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.27,0:05:42.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,but they were all human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.53,0:05:46.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I looked into their eyes as they died and saw who I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what I was capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:54.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what I'll be capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:57.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you telling me this tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.47,0:06:00.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you reall think this would change my mind about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:03.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wondered if it would change your mind about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,And who you'll want see in the mirror a year from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:12.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you why,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.66,0:06:16.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,because you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,You should give yourself some credit for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.14,0:06:22.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hopefully a year from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.56,0:06:24.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll look in the mirror and see someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:30.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone capable of courage,sacrifice,and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.39,0:06:33.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,love.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.50,0:06:40.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is that? - Come on! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.64,0:06:42.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm late for my bachelor party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.87,0:06:46.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Send him out Bella,or we're coming in after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.75,0:06:51.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,So this party,will there be strippers?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,No,just a couple of mountain lions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe a few bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.97,0:07:01.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry Bella,we'll get him back in plenty of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.89,0:07:05.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK go,before they break my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll meet you at the altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.47,0:07:20.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one in white.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's very convincing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.37,0:09:14.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did I say about beauty sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.88,0:09:17.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry. Bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.93,0:09:20.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's wedding jitters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you need some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can do her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.61,0:09:29.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.56,0:09:36.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please. I'm not offended by your choice of groom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:39.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just my blatant lack of respect for mortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Essentially.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.50,0:09:46.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Weddings,they bring everyone together!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:50.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey,Phil,did you find our daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.35,0:09:52.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are those graduation caps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:55.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hah! How creative!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Or weird. - Alice? Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.85,0:10:01.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,In here,Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.84,0:10:09.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh! You're so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.73,0:10:12.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Crap! My mascara.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.23,0:10:15.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.12,0:10:18.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Charlie,get in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You sure? I don't wanna ...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.67,0:10:30.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know. I look hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:33.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've thought you needed something blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,And something old.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:38.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Besides your mother. - Ah,nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.93,0:10:43.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It was grandma Swan's. - But we added the sapphires.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.27,0:10:45.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:47.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wow. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:50.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's your first family heirloom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:55.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pass it on to your daughter,and her daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mom,I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.59,0:11:05.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! No smudging my masterpiece!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.11,0:11:06.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.11,0:11:11.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's time for the dress!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:21.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to see it? - I wanna see!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.99,0:11:38.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,They've got to be related.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.10,0:11:40.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,What a gene pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.14,0:11:45.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've got some drool.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.43,0:11:50.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,So,do you think Bella will be showing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jess,she is not pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:55.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay! Who else gets married at 18?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:23.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.55,0:12:29.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just don't let me fall,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.59,0:12:31.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.43,0:14:40.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,we're gathered here on this glorious day
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:42.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,to witness the union of
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:44.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,Edward Cullen and Bella Swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.55,0:14:47.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,"I,Edward Cullen."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.47,0:14:51.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I,Edward Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.20,0:14:54.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Take you,Bella Swan."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.45,0:14:55.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take you,Bella Swan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.91,0:14:57.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,"To have and to hold."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.16,0:15:02.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,To have and to hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:04.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,For better or for worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:07.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,For richer or for poorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:11.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,In sickness and in health.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,To love.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:17.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,To cherish.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.91,0:15:20.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,As long as we both shall live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:23.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:25.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.66,0:15:30.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.80,0:16:38.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just thought it would be bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.73,0:16:40.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hi guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.34,0:16:42.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were just saying how pretty everything is. We were all just saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:45.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thanks so much. You don't think it's too much?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.28,0:16:47.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,No! Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.56,0:16:50.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey man! Nice to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.82,0:16:52.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for you.Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.30,0:16:54.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll be happy,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.28,0:16:56.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:16:58.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Have you heard from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.06,0:17:02.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure Jake wishes you the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well,I plan on getting drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.84,0:17:10.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're serving some pretty fancy champagne. Sue,can I get you a glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.90,0:17:12.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sparkling is fine with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sounds great.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:18.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.73,0:17:21.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Congratulations! - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.36,0:17:24.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Eleazar and Carmen,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:27.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,And these are cousins from Alaska. Tanya and Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.70,0:17:28.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've heard so much about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.95,0:17:32.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.23,0:17:38.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Irina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come meet Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.15,0:17:47.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I can't do this. - You've promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.25,0:17:51.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,They've invited one...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.57,0:17:58.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Irina,he is our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.39,0:18:00.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,They killed Laurent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.90,0:18:02.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,He tried to kill Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.84,0:18:06.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't believe that! He wanted to be like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.37,0:18:08.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,To live in peace with humans,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:15.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Irina!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.72,0:18:19.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's not monopolize the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.51,0:18:21.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Congratulations! - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:27.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's a wedding without family drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.91,0:18:30.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Is this on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:33.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.85,0:18:39.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to propose a toast,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.12,0:18:40.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,to my new sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.59,0:18:45.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella,I hope you've got enough sleep these last 18 years
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.46,0:18:47.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,cause you won't be getting anymore for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:56.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella was just like everybody else
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.25,0:18:59.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,totally mesmerized by Edward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.01,0:19:02.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or "The Hair" as I called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.26,0:19:08.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,And then suddenly,Edward is all about Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:13.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Although she's not captain of the volleyball team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:15.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or the president of the Student Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.95,0:19:19.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Edward will be a good husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.63,0:19:23.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know this because...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.51,0:19:31.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like how to hunt somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:33.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,till the ends of the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now that you're my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.31,0:19:39.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have to get over your aversion to fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.27,0:19:41.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I know how to use a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:44.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Skirts,heels,and handbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.36,0:19:48.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Go to sleep,my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.99,0:19:51.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,When you wake,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:58.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,you'll see me."
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.66,0:20:00.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd like to thank Renee and Charlie
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:03.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,for bringing such a wonderful person into the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.34,0:20:05.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,And into our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.01,0:20:08.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll cherish and protect her forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.78,0:20:10.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's an extraordinary thing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.60,0:20:15.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,to meet someone who you can bare your soul to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.18,0:20:18.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll accept you for what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.44,0:20:25.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting what seems like a very long time
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.91,0:20:29.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,to get beyond what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.93,0:20:33.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,With Bella,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.76,0:20:36.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel like I can finally begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:45.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,So I'd like to propose a toast to my beautiful bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:51.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,No measure of time with you will be long enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:56.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,but let's start with forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.12,0:21:27.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Another of your gifts has just arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.43,0:21:29.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:31.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's a wedding present doing in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:37.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a little more private.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.26,0:21:40.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,The best man didn't have time to get a tux.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.75,0:21:42.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:49.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.52,0:21:53.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hey Bella. - Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.01,0:21:55.33,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:56.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kind is my middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.08,0:22:04.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll see if Rosalie wants to dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.25,0:22:08.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.79,0:22:12.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything is perfect now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.41,0:22:16.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dance with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.29,0:22:29.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:34.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,We were gonna put your face on a milk carton.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.80,0:22:36.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mostly northern Canada.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.15,0:22:39.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.57,0:22:42.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's weird to be back on two legs again,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.18,0:22:44.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,with clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:48.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I fell out of practice with the whole human thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:52.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.15,0:22:55.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,being here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:23:02.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why? Afraid I'll trash your party?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.31,0:23:13.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.87,0:23:19.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'd think I'd be used to telling you goodbye by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:26.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on,you're not supposed to be the one crying,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.75,0:23:33.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone cries at weddings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.49,0:23:37.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is how I'll remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.61,0:23:40.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pink cheeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Two left feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.54,0:23:51.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Heart beat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.61,0:23:56.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,So what,soon I'm gonna be dead to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.56,0:23:57.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.09,0:24:09.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.87,0:24:13.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to appreciate your last night as human.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.01,0:24:16.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not my last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.73,0:24:22.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? I thought you...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.00,0:24:27.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't really wanna spend my honeymoon writhing in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.64,0:24:29.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.80,0:24:34.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not like you're gonna have a real honeymoon with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.12,0:24:37.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,It will be as real as any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.24,0:24:38.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a sick joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:41.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're joking?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.50,0:24:45.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,What? While you're still human?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.20,0:24:48.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious Bella. Tell me you're not that stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.79,0:24:51.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean it's really none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.99,0:24:54.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,- No,you can't do this. - Jake...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.31,0:24:56.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Listen to me,Bella. - Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.84,0:24:58.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob,calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.74,0:25:00.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you out of your mind? Huh? You'll kill her!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.46,0:25:03.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake,walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.17,0:25:09.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Enough,Jacob!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.18,0:25:11.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this,Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.82,0:25:13.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna start something that we'll have to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.79,0:25:16.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She'll die! - She's not our concern anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.03,0:25:37.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go,Seth!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.63,0:25:45.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm really stupid. - No,it's alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.20,0:25:49.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,They probably miss us. Let's go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.77,0:26:13.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,He won't tell you where he's taking you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.74,0:26:15.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,No,it's surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.36,0:26:22.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well,wear a hat and use sunscreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.39,0:26:25.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Take care. - I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.22,0:26:27.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.91,0:26:31.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.81,0:26:33.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.02,0:26:35.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,So much.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.05,0:26:45.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.97,0:26:55.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything is packed and ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.46,0:26:56.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.86,0:27:05.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'll go see him. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.87,0:27:17.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:22.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:26.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be strange,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.28,0:27:30.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not living under my roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.54,0:27:32.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.13,0:27:35.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,It will be strange for me,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.47,0:27:41.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know it'll always be your home,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:51.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you,Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.47,0:27:53.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.89,0:28:00.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you too,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.10,0:28:03.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,I always have and always will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.56,0:28:11.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.73,0:28:17.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on. Don't want to miss your plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.84,0:28:19.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wherever it's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.85,0:28:25.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.34,0:28:28.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.39,0:28:34.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.74,0:28:56.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.06,0:30:05.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Pare o carro.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.29,0:30:47.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,So we're not staying in Rio?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.81,0:30:49.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,No,just passing through.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.01,0:30:51.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are we close?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.12,0:31:09.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's Isle Esme.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.20,0:31:12.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a gift from Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.98,0:31:30.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this totally necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.14,0:31:33.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm nothing if not traditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.18,0:31:49.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Want to take a look around?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.76,0:32:41.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.53,0:32:49.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Want a swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.64,0:32:51.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah,sounds nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.49,0:33:01.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need a few minutes as a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.21,0:33:10.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't delay,Mrs. Cullen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.37,0:33:14.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.69,0:33:37.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,OK...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.07,0:34:15.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alice!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.68,0:34:39.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't be a coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.49,0:35:34.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're so beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.67,0:35:56.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise that we'd try,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.23,0:36:00.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,but if this doesn't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.29,0:36:03.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.68,0:36:50.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.98,0:38:41.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella,you're hurt
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.31,0:38:45.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.21,0:38:56.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,No,Bella. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.16,0:39:09.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how sorry I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.88,0:39:25.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.86,0:39:27.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,Really,I'm not. I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.02,0:39:29.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't say you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.97,0:39:32.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.00,0:39:34.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,No,you don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.11,0:39:36.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't ruin this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.47,0:39:38.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've already ruined it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.45,0:39:44.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why can't see you how perfectly happy I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.49,0:39:47.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or was,five seconds ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.71,0:39:51.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now I'm sorta pissed off actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.78,0:39:53.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well,you should be angry with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.65,0:39:56.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,We knew this was going to be tricky,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.60,0:40:00.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think we did amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.29,0:40:06.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was amazing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.28,0:40:08.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what you're worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.64,0:40:11.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,That I didn't enjoy myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.74,0:40:16.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know it's not the same for you but
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.21,0:40:20.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,for a human...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.90,0:40:23.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine it gets better.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.41,0:40:31.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Last night was the best night of my existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.53,0:40:38.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.53,0:40:57.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're not gonna touch me again,are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.44,0:41:05.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.89,0:41:07.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me make you breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.89,0:43:22.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.74,0:43:39.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.86,0:43:44.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,You having a nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.19,0:43:46.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.39,0:43:57.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.34,0:44:01.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,It was a really good dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.58,0:44:03.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.77,0:44:07.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanted it to be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.72,0:44:10.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.37,0:44:17.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.60,0:44:23.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.30,0:44:26.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.39,0:45:02.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe they'll say she was in a car crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.69,0:45:05.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Or tripped and fell off a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.91,0:45:15.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least,I'll get one thing out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.65,0:45:19.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,No you won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.73,0:45:23.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,The Cullens are not a danger to the town or tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.43,0:45:26.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,He will kill her or change her.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.90,0:45:30.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And the treaty says... - I say,Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.55,0:45:31.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.68,0:45:41.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,You know if you wanted things different,you should've become Alpha.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.44,0:45:46.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Turning it down seemed like a good idea at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.68,0:45:51.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake,you really think you could kill Bella if she comes back as a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.13,0:45:54.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. He would make one of us do it,then hold a grudge against...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.58,0:45:55.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Shut up,Leah.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.90,0:45:57.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Would you just get over it?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.69,0:45:59.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not like you imprinted on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.26,0:46:03.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least they seem happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.16,0:46:07.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Some people are just lucky,I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.16,0:46:09.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Lucky?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.04,0:46:13.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,None of them belong to themselves anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.79,0:46:15.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,And the sickest part is?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.96,0:46:17.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Their genes tell them they're happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.82,0:46:22.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least if you imprinted on someone,you'll finally forget Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.66,0:46:29.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean,being any kind of happy is better
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.15,0:46:32.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,than being miserable about someone you can't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.12,0:46:52.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella,these are our housekeepers,Gustavo and Kaure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.26,0:46:55.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is my wife,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.73,0:46:56.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.86,0:47:02.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Guess,we should just leave them to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.37,0:47:09.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.84,0:47:11.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.96,0:47:13.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.87,0:47:17.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I have you here all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.20,0:47:20.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait,she knows about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.43,0:47:23.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,She suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.30,0:47:25.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's native Ticuna.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.64,0:47:28.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,They have legends of blood drinking demons
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.07,0:47:31.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,who prey on beautiful women.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.31,0:47:35.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.41,0:48:12.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've gone to the mainland to hunt,be back befor you wake
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.41,0:48:14.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You are late.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.92,0:49:12.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.80,0:49:16.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't come in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.24,0:49:19.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't need to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.32,0:49:23.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,In sickness and in health,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.76,0:49:26.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,It must have been the chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.67,0:49:28.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you grab my bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.17,0:49:45.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.87,0:49:52.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,How many days it has been since the wedding?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.87,0:49:54.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,14,why?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.43,0:49:58.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.64,0:50:02.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.97,0:50:05.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,My period is late.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.97,0:50:23.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.96,0:50:28.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.96,0:50:48.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alice. - Bella,are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.57,0:50:53.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm not one hundred percent sure. - Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.57,0:50:54.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I just... - You just what?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.97,0:50:58.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Alice,what did you see? - Here's Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.29,0:51:00.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella,what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.96,0:51:03.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a little worried. Can vampires go into shock?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.47,0:51:05.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Has anyone being harmed? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.40,0:51:13.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know it's impossible,but I think I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.02,0:51:23.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carlisle,I swear something just moved inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.77,0:51:28.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is this even possible? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.25,0:51:30.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,What is he saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.59,0:51:33.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,The sooner she is here,the sooner we can find out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.12,0:51:35.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I need you to get to the mainland at once. - Yeah,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.85,0:51:43.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.28,0:51:55.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.90,0:51:57.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Kaure is making sure that you're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.74,0:53:15.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you do with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.90,0:53:18.73,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.65,0:53:22.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know that you're a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.78,0:53:25.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've killed this little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.36,0:53:27.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.52,0:53:30.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,People have legends. You've seen this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.94,0:53:33.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please. Tell me how to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.10,0:53:36.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You only do bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.28,0:53:37.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.15,0:53:40.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.60,0:53:42.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.01,0:53:44.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.81,0:53:47.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me how she can survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.32,0:54:20.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.78,0:54:38.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will not let it hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.00,0:54:43.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carlisle will get that thing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.64,0:54:57.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,"Thing"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.79,0:55:22.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait here while we load.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.58,0:55:50.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Hello. - Rosalie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.77,0:55:51.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.87,0:55:58.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What's going on? - I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.50,0:56:25.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey,son.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.57,0:56:26.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.47,0:56:28.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella called him.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.73,0:56:35.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey,I haven't seen you in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.40,0:56:38.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Are you OK? - So you finally heard from Bella?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.61,0:56:42.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,They've extended their trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.66,0:56:44.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,It seems she caught a bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.18,0:56:46.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,They wanna wait until she feels better before they travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.80,0:56:48.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's sick...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.58,0:56:51.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah,she told me not to worry,but she sounded...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.33,0:56:57.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know,off.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.88,0:56:59.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,She'll be fine,Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.62,0:57:02.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on. Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.60,0:57:14.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.31,0:57:16.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let it go...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.36,0:57:39.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Is it true? - Hello,Jacob. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.24,0:57:42.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen,just give it to me straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.46,0:57:44.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake,is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.02,0:57:48.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- She's here? - They came home 2 weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.76,0:57:50.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.80,0:58:12.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.07,0:58:17.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Close enough. - What's your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.89,0:58:20.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rose,it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.07,0:58:32.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,You look terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.62,0:58:38.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah,it's nice to see you,too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.21,0:58:45.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,So are you going to tell me what's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.56,0:58:49.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rose,do you wanna help me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.20,0:59:09.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did this!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.92,0:59:12.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was even possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.89,0:59:14.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What is it? - I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.87,0:59:18.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Ultrasound and needles won't penetrate the embryo sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.72,0:59:19.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't see it either,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.77,0:59:24.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,and I can't see Bella's future anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.66,0:59:27.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,We've been researching legends,but there isn't much to go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.34,0:59:30.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,What we do know is that it's strong and fast growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.41,0:59:32.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why haven't you done anything?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.66,0:59:33.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,Take it out of her!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.62,0:59:36.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is none of your business,dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.27,0:59:37.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rose!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.75,0:59:41.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- All this fighting isn't good for Bella. - The fetus isn't good for Bella.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.79,0:59:46.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Say the word,Alice. "Baby." It's just a little baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.18,0:59:48.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.44,0:59:52.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carlisle,you've got to do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.83,0:59:54.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.94,0:59:57.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not his decision,it's not any of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.51,0:59:59.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob,I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.59,1:00:12.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,I always knew you would destroy her.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.93,1:00:18.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,She thinks Carlisle can turn her at the last minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.42,1:00:21.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,As he did with me and Esme.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.18,1:00:26.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Can he? - The probability is slight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.38,1:00:30.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,If her heart fails...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.38,1:00:39.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look,Jacob,I need you to do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.36,1:00:43.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,For her?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.32,1:00:50.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have a connection with her that I'll never understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.89,1:00:52.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe you could talk to her,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.79,1:00:54.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,change her mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.64,1:00:57.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could keep her alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.28,1:01:01.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,And if I can't?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.98,1:01:05.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,If she dies,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.64,1:01:11.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,you'll get what you've always wanted...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.24,1:01:15.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,To kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.71,1:01:28.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rose,I'm fine. Really.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.76,1:01:49.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,So Edward sent you to come talk to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.72,1:01:51.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sort of...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.07,1:01:53.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Though I can't figure out why he thinks you'd listen to me,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.73,1:01:55.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,I mean you never have before.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.69,1:02:06.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Since when are you and Blondie BFF's?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.11,1:02:08.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rose understands what I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.04,1:02:15.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you thinking,Bella?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.77,1:02:17.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.52,1:02:19.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know this seems a scary thing,but
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.97,1:02:23.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,it's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.56,1:02:26.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like this miracle or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.14,1:02:29.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can feel him.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.06,1:02:33.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,So it's a bouncing baby boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.68,1:02:36.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,I don't know. I should've brought blue balloons.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.44,1:02:37.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's just a guess.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.12,1:02:41.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,When I picture him I see a boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.32,1:02:45.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll see!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.43,1:02:49.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You won't. - Jake,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.19,1:02:53.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I'm strong enough. - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.62,1:02:58.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can spout that crap to your bloodsucker,but you don't fool me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.71,1:03:01.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can see what that thing is doing to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.36,1:03:04.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,- It's a killer,Bella! - You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.76,1:03:08.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,When you die,what was the point?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.23,1:03:10.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of me loving you,you loving him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.43,1:03:12.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's that right for anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.71,1:03:14.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Because I sure don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.57,1:03:24.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me,Bella...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.34,1:03:26.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.98,1:03:29.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just don't do this...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.47,1:03:32.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,Live,okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.83,1:03:33.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.90,1:03:38.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake,everything will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.83,1:03:52.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake,don't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.08,1:03:55.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know how this ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.22,1:03:59.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'm not sticking around to watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.29,1:04:39.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake,I can do this...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.58,1:04:45.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is none of your business,dog!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.53,1:04:48.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake,don't go...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.26,1:04:49.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,You did this...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.05,1:04:51.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything is going to be okay...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.83,1:04:53.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fetus isn't good for Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.08,1:04:55.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know how this ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.65,1:04:58.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,...It's killing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.80,1:05:26.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake!!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.01,1:05:46.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it true,Jacob?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.55,1:05:47.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's growing fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.08,1:05:49.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's unnatural!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.16,1:05:49.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.10,1:05:50.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Monstrosity! Abombination!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.43,1:05:53.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,On our land.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.63,1:05:57.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't allow it!!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.21,1:05:59.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have to protect the tribe!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.12,1:06:03.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,What they've bred won't be able to control its thirst.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.66,1:06:05.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Every human will be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.03,1:06:07.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're ready. - We're underway!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.41,1:06:09.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,Now
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.57,1:06:13.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,We must destroy it before it's born.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.28,1:06:15.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,You mean,kill Bella?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.32,1:06:17.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,Her choice affects us all.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.11,1:06:20.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella's human. Our protection applies to her.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.35,1:06:21.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,She's dying anyway!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.60,1:06:28.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,We have real enemies to fight tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.97,1:06:32.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tonight?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.53,1:06:37.43,ENG,,0,0,0,,And you will fight with us,Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.47,1:06:59.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,I will not!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.40,1:07:03.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I am the grandson of Ephraim Black!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.46,1:07:07.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the grandson of a chief!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.36,1:07:12.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wasn't born to follow you or anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.30,1:07:53.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. They're not following us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.23,1:07:54.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.49,1:07:57.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I left Sam's pack. - Go home,Seth.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.11,1:07:59.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I won't stand behind him. - Oh,yes,you will!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.84,1:08:02.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding. Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.18,1:08:05.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that an order?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.92,1:08:07.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,You gonna make me bow down,too?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.08,1:08:09.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not ordering anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.97,1:08:13.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just going off on my own here,okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.44,1:08:14.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.62,1:08:17.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,- And I've got your back. - No,you don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.55,1:08:21.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,If Sam comes after Bella,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.39,1:08:24.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,are you really ready to fight your own brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.07,1:08:26.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your sister?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.97,1:08:29.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,If it's the right thing to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.97,1:08:35.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.98,1:08:38.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go give the Cullen's the heads up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.27,1:08:40.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.97,1:08:46.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,How cool is this?!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.97,1:08:48.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,A two man pack!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.77,1:08:50.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Two against the world. - You're getting on my nerves,Seth.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.20,1:08:52.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.59,1:08:54.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.39,1:08:59.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.97,1:09:02.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're coming for Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.31,1:09:06.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,They're not going to touch her.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.26,1:09:08.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Agreed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.90,1:09:16.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,Man,I can smell them all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.28,1:09:19.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.49,1:09:21.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let my little brother get himself killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.49,1:09:24.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Go away,Leah! I'll take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.15,1:09:26.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,That you think so proves that you need a babysitter.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.07,1:09:27.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Will both of you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.64,1:09:33.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Sam send you? - Sam doesn't even know I left.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.50,1:09:40.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think he's just figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.97,1:09:43.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.90,1:09:46.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what his plan is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.57,1:09:49.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sam's lost the element of surprise
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.27,1:09:51.66,ENG,,0,0,0,,and he doesn't wanna take you on outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.67,1:09:52.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,So he's not gonna come at you head on.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.83,1:09:56.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's got the place surrounded and he'll wait for an opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.74,1:09:57.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,He won't get through without a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.58,1:09:58.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,No fights.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.01,1:10:02.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We won't be the ones to break the treaty. - The treaty is void.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.04,1:10:05.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,- At least in Sam's mind. - Not in ours.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.85,1:10:08.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carlisle,no one's hunted for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.57,1:10:11.45,ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll make do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.50,1:10:17.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've done us a great service,Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.44,1:10:18.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.44,1:10:50.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know they're out there somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.17,1:10:53.89,ENG,,0,0,0,,but I can't hear them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.70,1:10:57.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's so quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.86,1:10:59.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've stopped hearing them,too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.78,1:11:02.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,The second I decided to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.57,1:11:05.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.76,1:11:09.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You know you can't stay here. - But I don't have any place...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.83,1:11:11.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't trust you with the Cullen's.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.57,1:11:13.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,You hate them too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.34,1:11:17.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You don't even like me. - I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.02,1:11:20.85,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just have to follow you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.38,1:11:24.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look,Seth doesn't want you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.11,1:11:27.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.77,1:11:33.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Being unwanted isn't exactly a new thing to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.68,1:11:51.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look,I'll stay out of your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.21,1:11:55.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever you want,except go back to Sam's pack
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.19,1:11:58.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,and be the pathetic ex- girlfriend he can't get away from.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.07,1:12:03.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't know how many times I wished I could imprint on someone.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.31,1:12:07.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Anyone...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.12,1:12:09.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just to break the connection.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.37,1:12:26.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alright...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.46,1:12:30.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna do a perimeter around.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.63,1:12:32.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Got my flank?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.67,1:13:49.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Her rib is cracked,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.82,1:13:52.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,but they're no splinters.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.83,1:13:54.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,It hasn't punctured anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.84,1:13:56.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Yet... - Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.67,1:14:01.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's breaking her bones now.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.35,1:14:04.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's crushing you from the inside out.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.86,1:14:08.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carlisle,tell her what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.37,1:14:10.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell her.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.67,1:14:14.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carlisle,tell me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.06,1:14:16.64,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's alright.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.36,1:14:29.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,The fetus isn't compatible with your body.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.37,1:14:33.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's too strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.59,1:14:35.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,It won't allow you to get the nutrition you need.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.53,1:14:40.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's starving you by the hour,I can't stop it and I can't slow it down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.21,1:14:46.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,At this rate,your heart will give out before you can deliver.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.92,1:14:53.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Then I'll hold on as long as I can and ... - Bella...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.38,1:14:57.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,There are some conditions even venom can't overcome.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.61,1:15:00.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.31,1:15:01.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.47,1:15:17.63,ENG,,0,0,0,,Edward,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.87,1:15:19.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't live without you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.19,1:15:22.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You won't. You'll have a part of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.81,1:15:24.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,He'll need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.62,1:15:26.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think I could love
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.57,1:15:29.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,or even tolerate it,if it killed you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.95,1:15:32.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not his fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.60,1:15:37.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You have to accept what it is. - Because you've given me no choice!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.23,1:15:41.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella,we're supposed to be partners,remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.90,1:15:44.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,But you've decided this on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.68,1:15:46.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've decided to leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.17,1:15:49.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Don't see it that way. - Well I have no other way to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.52,1:15:50.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,Cause it's me who'll lose you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.48,1:15:52.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I don't choose that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.71,1:15:55.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't choose that.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.69,1:16:59.02,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you cold?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.67,1:17:01.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.63,1:17:10.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.05,1:17:11.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.39,1:17:16.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Smile like I'm your favorite person in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.14,1:17:18.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.74,1:17:23.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,It feels complete when you're here,Jake.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.43,1:17:40.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,We need to find a way to get some food into her system.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:42.36,1:17:44.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,- If only I could see the fetus, - Baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.04,1:17:48.42,ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe I could figure out what it wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.86,1:17:56.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think you might be right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.76,1:17:58.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob just had an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.71,1:18:03.46,ENG,,0,0,0,,It wasn't an idea,it was a snide comment.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.50,1:18:05.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.37,1:18:09.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,That it's probably just looking for someone to sink its teeth into.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.27,1:18:21.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's thirsty?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.77,1:18:25.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know the feeling.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.82,1:18:29.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,If it's craving,it's not gonna want animal blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.45,1:18:31.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,I have some Type O negative laid aside for Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.94,1:18:36.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Walk with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.53,1:18:59.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait! Wait! You're going to make her drink that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.57,1:19:02.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the fastest way to test the theory.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.47,1:19:04.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Only if you're comfortable with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.74,1:19:06.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll try anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.94,1:19:10.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just hold on...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.92,1:19:13.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to be sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.17,1:19:24.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,It'll make it a little easier to take.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.56,1:19:55.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,It tastes...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.68,1:19:59.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.19,1:20:26.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your pulse is already getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.77,1:20:28.22,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's working.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.69,1:20:52.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You sound better. - I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.67,1:20:53.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,I feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.00,1:20:57.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,This whole thing must have put a kink in the honeymoon,huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.69,1:21:00.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,You could say that...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.58,1:21:03.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,Otherwise married life treating you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.45,1:21:06.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Edward still walks on water and all that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.76,1:21:09.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah,I mean it is different now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.74,1:21:13.44,ENG,,0,0,0,,The important thing is that you're better and that you're coming home soon. Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.77,1:21:16.09,ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay,Dad,I don't want you to freak out
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.36,1:21:18.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.10,1:21:22.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to a medical center in Switzerland.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.17,1:21:25.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?! You're not going to Switzerland!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.32,1:21:26.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You said you were better! - I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.01,1:21:30.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,No Bella,I'm getting on a plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.72,1:21:36.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,No!It's really more of a ...a spa.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.89,1:21:41.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'm sure I'll be better before you got there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.32,1:21:42.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,I...uh...I don't know
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.97,1:21:44.41,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad,don't come.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.45,1:21:46.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,Picture me healthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.44,1:21:49.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like I'm sitting on the couch with you,eating pizza or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.42,1:21:51.19,ENG,,0,0,0,,You want me to visualize?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.23,1:21:52.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,They say it helps.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.34,1:21:55.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just picture me like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.49,1:21:59.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.17,1:22:01.31,ENG,,0,0,0,,It'll make me feel better.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.62,1:22:04.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Dad,I gotta go. OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.38,1:22:05.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.57,1:22:07.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I love you. - Bella...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.44,1:22:30.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry I've been so angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.87,1:22:34.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,I would be too.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.20,1:22:36.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,I've left you alone in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.39,1:22:44.18,ENG,,0,0,0,,Marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.13,1:22:51.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,They say the first year is the hardest.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.19,1:22:59.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What was that? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.01,1:23:01.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought I've just heard.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.73,1:23:05.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Just say something else...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.24,1:23:06.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.42,1:23:13.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,Edward,what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.21,1:23:16.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,He likes the sound of your voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.10,1:23:17.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You can hear him?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.19,1:23:20.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,Mind.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.67,1:23:24.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,He likes my voice as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.12,1:23:26.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.97,1:23:28.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you hear?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.62,1:23:30.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,So strange...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.31,1:23:35.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought he was like me,but he's not,he's like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.27,1:23:37.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good and pure.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.27,1:23:39.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.22,1:23:44.32,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.88,1:23:47.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course you're happy. How can you not be?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.42,1:23:50.94,ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you so much!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.24,1:23:54.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you hear now?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.82,1:23:57.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,He loves you,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.58,1:24:01.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.96,1:24:35.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.37,1:24:46.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,So that's the last of it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.28,1:24:48.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella can deliver as early as tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.00,1:24:51.04,ENG,,0,0,0,,If she's going to have any chance at all she'll need more blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.08,1:24:52.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,You need to feed.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.89,1:24:55.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,You have to be at your strongest for her. We need to go tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.69,1:24:57.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carlisle,you're the enemy now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.22,1:25:00.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,Sam won't hesitate. You will be slaughtered.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.87,1:25:02.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Emmett will come with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.68,1:25:05.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,- That won't be enough. - We have no choice,Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.51,1:25:08.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,If there's anything we can do to save her,we have to try.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.30,1:25:09.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,You would risk your lives for her?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.00,1:25:11.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,Of course we would.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.64,1:25:14.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella's part of our family now.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.39,1:25:17.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.82,1:25:19.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.79,1:25:23.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,This really is a family.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.12,1:25:28.96,ENG,,0,0,0,,As strong as the one I was born into.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.66,1:25:33.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,I know what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.07,1:25:56.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake,they're coming!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.83,1:25:58.90,ENG,,0,0,0,,- I know. - We should phase,Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.94,1:26:00.57,ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't protect ourselves like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.58,1:26:02.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll see us as a threat.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.03,1:26:04.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,I wanna talk!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.19,1:26:07.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be easier if I could hear you,too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.62,1:26:18.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,This isn't your territory anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.20,1:26:21.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,How's your new family working out?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.15,1:26:22.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You done?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.81,1:26:25.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,You coming home,Jake?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.16,1:26:27.80,ENG,,0,0,0,,Not until I finish this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.94,1:26:28.67,ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.97,1:26:31.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want Sam to take back Leah and Seth.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.59,1:26:33.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,- What? - No way!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.15,1:26:34.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.94,1:26:40.47,ENG,,0,0,0,,I want them safe and I want this over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.18,1:26:54.86,ENG,,0,0,0,,I need Sam to wait until Bella's been separated from the problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.90,1:26:57.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,- You mean until she's dead? - Ease up,Paul.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.78,1:27:00.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Then what?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.16,1:27:02.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell Sam that when the moment comes,
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.13,1:27:05.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be the one to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.23,1:27:06.23,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jake!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.98,1:27:08.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who can.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.13,1:27:12.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,They trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.12,1:28:10.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,You've played us!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.42,1:28:33.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.37,1:28:36.60,ENG,,0,0,0,,- They make it out alright? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.64,1:28:37.35,ENG,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.20,1:28:48.50,ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.53,1:28:51.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.86,1:28:54.30,ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah,it's not like I'm not one carrying a demon.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.02,1:28:57.95,ENG,,0,0,0,,This is pretty important,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.97,1:28:59.79,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell Jacob what you've decided to?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.05,1:29:02.54,ENG,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.06,1:29:05.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rose is trying to talk Bella out of her baby names.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.47,1:29:07.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,She hates them.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.62,1:29:10.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Well then I'm on your side no matter what you pick.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.29,1:29:12.59,ENG,,0,0,0,,They are not that bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.62,1:29:14.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,If it's a boy,E.J.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.00,1:29:17.71,ENG,,0,0,0,,Edward Jacob.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.97,1:29:22.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine,that one isn't awful.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.25,1:29:25.49,ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you tell him the girl's name?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.67,1:29:29.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was playing around with our mom's names.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.57,1:29:32.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Renee and Esme.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.17,1:29:36.84,ENG,,0,0,0,,I was thinking Renesmee.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.82,1:29:42.51,ENG,,0,0,0,,R- Renesmee?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.70,1:29:47.38,ENG,,0,0,0,,Too weird?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.27,1:29:50.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's not too weird.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.27,1:29:54.74,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.77,1:29:56.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,And it's unique.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.97,1:29:58.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,It certainly fits the situation.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.92,1:30:02.75,ENG,,0,0,0,,I like Renesmee.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.07,1:30:09.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,He likes it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.07,1:30:33.13,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rosalie,pass the morphine.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.22,1:30:38.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Carlisle said that the placenta must have detached.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.59,1:30:42.36,ENG,,0,0,0,,- He's coming as fast as he can. - We'll have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.53,1:30:48.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rose,let the morphine spread.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.53,1:30:51.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,There's no time. He's dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.16,1:30:52.21,ENG,,0,0,0,,Get him out now!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.76,1:30:54.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at me,Bella.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.56,1:31:05.83,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rosalie,don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.11,1:31:07.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alice,get her out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.78,1:31:10.91,ENG,,0,0,0,,Rosalie!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.71,1:31:15.56,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Save her! You gotta change her! - I can't! Not whilst he's still in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.89,1:31:16.92,ENG,,0,0,0,,I gotta get him out first.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.15,1:31:22.06,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay focused. Keep your heart beating.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.13,1:31:23.29,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's suffocating!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.53,1:32:06.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's Renesmee!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.07,1:32:15.88,ENG,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.60,1:32:55.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.59,1:32:57.25,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella?!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.51,1:33:00.15,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella?!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.66,1:33:09.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob,take the baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.15,1:33:10.70,ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep that away from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.14,1:33:12.39,ENG,,0,0,0,,Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.01,1:33:14.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.27,1:33:17.16,ENG,,0,0,0,,I promise I'm okay,let me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.14,1:33:27.08,ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.59,1:33:32.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,My venom.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.04,1:34:01.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,It supposed to be working.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.83,1:34:16.77,ENG,,0,0,0,,I won't kill you...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.34,1:34:18.28,ENG,,0,0,0,,That would be too easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.31,1:34:22.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,You deserve to live with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.30,1:35:00.24,ENG,,0,0,0,,She didn't make it...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.51,1:35:15.76,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not dead. You're not dead...
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.47,1:35:17.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.46,1:35:21.12,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.60,1:35:30.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,No. It will work.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.03,1:35:34.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,Please,please...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.71,1:36:21.69,ENG,,0,0,0,,Come back to me please...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.19,1:36:25.52,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella,please.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.72,1:36:57.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care what he's done.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.35,1:37:00.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's still my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.75,1:37:01.53,ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry,Billy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.20,1:37:05.00,ENG,,0,0,0,,I just thought you should know.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.57,1:37:11.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,Bella is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.12,1:37:14.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,It killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.87,1:37:19.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.17,1:38:11.17,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's like gravity.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.89,1:38:14.05,ENG,,0,0,0,,Your whole center shifts.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.66,1:38:19.78,ENG,,0,0,0,,Suddenly,it's not the earth holding you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:20.82,1:38:22.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,You would do anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.07,1:38:25.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,be anything she needs.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.57,1:38:29.26,ENG,,0,0,0,,A Friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.57,1:38:31.55,ENG,,0,0,0,,A Brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.07,1:38:34.27,ENG,,0,0,0,,A Protector.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.06,1:38:57.34,ENG,,0,0,0,,Alice! Jasper!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.34,1:39:04.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.67,1:39:20.10,ENG,,0,0,0,,- We're outnumbered. - By a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.14,1:39:22.01,ENG,,0,0,0,,I won't let them hurt my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.87,1:40:41.87,ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop! It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.20,1:40:44.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,If you kill her,you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.07,1:41:00.40,ENG,,0,0,0,,Jacob imprinted.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:06.17,1:41:07.37,ENG,,0,0,0,,They can't hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.07,1:41:12.14,ENG,,0,0,0,,Whomever a wolf imprints on can't be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.07,1:41:19.11,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's their most absolute law.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.07,1:41:55.68,ENG,,0,0,0,,She shouldn't be so still.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.11,1:41:59.93,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's the morphine.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:01.23,1:42:03.98,ENG,,0,0,0,,- Maybe it was too late. - No,Edward.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.16,1:42:05.20,ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to her heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.26,1:47:29.48,ENG,,0,0,0,,It's from Carlisle.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.87,1:47:35.61,ENG,,0,0,0,,Which is spelled with an "S" sweet Bianca.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.81,1:47:46.07,ENG,,0,0,0,,He's added a new member to his coven.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.87,1:47:48.72,ENG,,0,0,0,,Increasing his power.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.47,1:48:01.62,ENG,,0,0,0,,First it's the spelling and the grammar.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.90,1:48:09.81,ENG,,0,0,0,,At least our dispute with the Cullens is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:10.63,1:48:11.65,ENG,,0,0,0,,Over?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.56,1:48:13.82,ENG,,0,0,0,,Goodness no...
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.17,1:48:20.03,ENG,,0,0,0,,Our dispute goes far beyond the fate of a mere human.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:21.15,1:48:22.97,ENG,,0,0,0,,And what might it be?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.18,1:48:25.99,ENG,,0,0,0,,I thought you understood
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.94,1:48:29.58,ENG,,0,0,0,,They have something I want.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.78,0:00:25.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,童年并非从出生到某一年龄的时间段
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.76,0:00:31.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,到了一定岁数 孩子会长大 抛开幼稚的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.90,0:00:42.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,童年是没有生老病死的国度
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.84,0:00:52.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 雅各布
Dialogue: 1,0:01:23.05,0:01:24.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,菲尔
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.99,0:01:30.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,终于盼来了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:43.74,0:01:45.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只要练习一下就好了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.70,0:01:48.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,我都练了3天了
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.10,0:01:50.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我能光着脚吗？- 不
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.00,0:01:52.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝对不行
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.53,0:01:54.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得这有点过了 不是吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,婚纱 鞋子
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.57,0:01:58.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有这些
Dialogue: 1,0:01:59.91,0:02:02.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 这很重要
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.69,0:02:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,明天会非常完美
Dialogue: 1,0:02:05.43,0:02:06.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,放哪儿 老板娘？
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.16,0:02:08.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,通道的两边
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.34,0:02:11.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么通道？- 没人长眼睛吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.89,0:02:32.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,你 快回家睡个美容觉
Dialogue: 1,0:02:32.60,0:02:33.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是命令
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.09,0:02:36.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:03:23.48,0:03:25.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是看看你有没有紧张得手脚冰凉
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.45,0:03:31.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的脚热乎乎的
Dialogue: 1,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在改变主意还不晚
Dialogue: 1,0:03:33.32,0:03:34.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有其它想法了？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.92,0:03:38.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,有吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.39,0:03:43.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我为娶你已经等了一个世纪 斯旺小姐
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.26,0:03:46.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.12,0:03:48.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,可是？
Dialogue: 1,0:03:50.73,0:03:53.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你并不了解我的全部
Dialogue: 1,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,不了解什么？你不是处男？
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.41,0:04:06.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在别想把我吓跑
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.43,0:04:12.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔把我变成吸血鬼的几年后
Dialogue: 1,0:04:13.40,0:04:14.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我向他反抗
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.48,0:04:18.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我讨厌他扼制我的欲望
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.38,0:04:21.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,有一阵子 我离家出走
Dialogue: 1,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要知道追寻猎物的感觉
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.60,0:04:32.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,想要尝人血的味道
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我杀的所有人
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.23,0:05:19.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,都是恶魔
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.28,0:05:25.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,于是我也成了恶魔
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.57,0:05:32.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德华 他们都是杀人犯
Dialogue: 1,0:05:33.96,0:05:36.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,你救的人也许比你杀的人还多
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.41,0:05:39.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉 我也是这么告诉自己的
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.27,0:05:42.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,但他们都是活生生的人
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.53,0:05:46.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们临死时 我望着他们的眼睛 看见了我自己
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.76,0:05:49.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,和我的能力
Dialogue: 1,0:05:52.24,0:05:54.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我将拥有的能力
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.57,0:05:57.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你为什么今晚告诉我这些？
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.47,0:06:00.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的以为这会改变我对你的看法？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.35,0:06:03.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道这是否会改变你对自己的看法
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.00,0:06:06.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你希望一年后在镜中看到怎样的自己
Dialogue: 1,0:06:10.63,0:06:12.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我做得到
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来告诉你原因
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.66,0:06:16.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你能做到
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.02,0:06:19.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,这应该有你的功劳
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.14,0:06:22.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,希望一年后
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.56,0:06:24.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在镜子中看到的我就像你一样
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.02,0:06:30.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个有勇气 愿意牺牲
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.39,0:06:33.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,能够爱的人
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.50,0:06:40.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么声音？- 快点 我们走吧
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.64,0:06:42.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我该去参加我的告别单身的派对了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.87,0:06:46.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,放他走吧 贝拉 否则我们就进来拉人了
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.75,0:06:51.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么这个派对 会有脱衣舞娘吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.98,0:06:55.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有 只有一些山狮
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.96,0:06:57.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许有几头熊
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.97,0:07:01.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 贝拉 我们过一阵子会送他回来的
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.89,0:07:05.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,快走吧 免得他们把我房子掀了
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.79,0:07:16.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,婚礼上见
Dialogue: 1,0:07:18.47,0:07:20.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是穿的白色婚纱的那个
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.57,0:07:23.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,真有说服力
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.37,0:09:14.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是说要睡美容觉的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.88,0:09:17.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 做恶梦了
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.93,0:09:20.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能是婚前紧张症吧
Dialogue: 1,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以帮她弄头发
Dialogue: 1,0:09:27.61,0:09:29.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.56,0:09:36.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托 你要跟谁结婚 关我什么事
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.38,0:09:39.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是觉得我不尊重道德界线
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,基本上是
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.50,0:09:46.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,婚礼 会让大家走到一起的
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.00,0:09:50.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 菲尔 你有看到我们的女儿吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.35,0:09:52.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是毕业帽吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.24,0:09:55.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,哈 好有创意
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.02,0:09:59.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 或者古怪 - 爱丽丝？贝拉？
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.85,0:10:01.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,在这儿 妈
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.84,0:10:09.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天啊 你真美
Dialogue: 1,0:10:11.73,0:10:12.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死 我的睫毛膏
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.23,0:10:15.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:10:17.12,0:10:18.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,查理 快过来
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.72,0:10:22.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,确定吗？我可不想…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.67,0:10:30.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道 我看上去很精神
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.71,0:10:33.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们觉得你需要一件蓝色的东西
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.07,0:10:35.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,还要够老
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.50,0:10:38.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 除你妈妈之外 - 哦 够损…
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.93,0:10:43.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这是斯旺奶奶的 - 不过我们镶上了蓝宝石
Dialogue: 1,0:10:43.27,0:10:45.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,真漂亮啊
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.32,0:10:47.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,哇 非常感谢
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.83,0:10:50.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你的第一件传家宝
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.55,0:10:55.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,传给你的女儿 还有女儿的女儿
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.05,0:11:03.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,妈妈 我喜欢
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.59,0:11:05.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,别 别破坏了我的杰作
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.11,0:11:06.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,她说得对
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.11,0:11:11.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.65,0:11:18.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,该穿婚纱了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.11,0:11:21.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你们想要看看吗？- 我想看
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.99,0:11:38.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们肯定是一家人
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.10,0:11:40.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,多优良的基因库啊
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.80,0:11:42.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是盖的
Dialogue: 1,0:11:42.14,0:11:45.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你…流口水了
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.43,0:11:50.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为贝拉会现身吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰西 她没怀孕
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.90,0:11:55.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 还有谁18岁就结婚的？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.20,0:12:20.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.58,0:12:23.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的…
Dialogue: 1,0:12:27.55,0:12:29.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让我摔倒 老爸
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.59,0:12:31.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,绝对不会
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.43,0:14:40.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 在这个大喜的日子 我们欢聚一堂
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.07,0:14:42.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,一同见证爱德华·卡伦
Dialogue: 1,0:14:42.80,0:14:44.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,和贝拉·斯旺这对新人的结合
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.55,0:14:47.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,请跟我说
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.28,0:14:50.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 爱德华·卡伦
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.47,0:14:51.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我 爱德华·卡伦
Dialogue: 1,0:14:52.20,0:14:54.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,将与你 贝拉·斯旺
Dialogue: 1,0:14:54.45,0:14:55.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,将与你 贝拉·斯旺
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.91,0:14:57.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,永结同心
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.16,0:15:02.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,永结同心
Dialogue: 1,0:15:03.32,0:15:04.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,不论好坏
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.38,0:15:07.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,不论富有或贫苦
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.81,0:15:11.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,不论疾病或健康
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.14,0:15:14.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,都彼此相爱
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.30,0:15:17.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,并相互珍惜
Dialogue: 1,0:15:17.91,0:15:20.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,直到永远
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.02,0:15:23.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,我愿意
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.71,0:15:25.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我愿意
Dialogue: 1,0:15:28.32,0:15:29.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.66,0:15:30.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你
Dialogue: 1,0:16:35.80,0:16:38.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我原以为会再大些
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.73,0:16:40.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,嗨 你们好
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.34,0:16:42.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们才在聊这里真漂亮
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.16,0:16:45.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,太谢谢了 你们不觉得太铺张了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:45.28,0:16:47.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有 完全没有
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.56,0:16:50.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 哥们 很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.82,0:16:52.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,我替你高兴 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.30,0:16:54.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望你幸福 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.28,0:16:56.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 比利
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.82,0:16:58.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,你有他的消息吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.06,0:17:02.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定杰克会祝福你的
Dialogue: 1,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要去喝个痛快了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:05.84,0:17:10.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们准备的香槟很不错 苏珊 要我帮你拿一杯吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.90,0:17:12.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,她喝起泡葡萄酒就好
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.96,0:17:14.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,好极了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.10,0:17:18.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.73,0:17:21.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.36,0:17:24.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,艾丽莎和卡门 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.98,0:17:27.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,这些是来自阿拉斯加的表兄弟 塔尼亚和凯特
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.70,0:17:28.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们听到很多关于你的事了
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.40,0:17:30.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入大家庭
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.95,0:17:32.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.23,0:17:38.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,易瑞娜
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.98,0:17:40.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,来见见贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.15,0:17:47.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我做不到 - 你答应过
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.25,0:17:51.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们邀请了一个…
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.57,0:17:58.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,易瑞娜 他是我们的朋友
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.39,0:18:00.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们杀了劳伦特
Dialogue: 1,0:18:00.90,0:18:02.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,他想要杀贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.84,0:18:06.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不相信 他想要和我们一样
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.37,0:18:08.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,与人类和平共处
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.42,0:18:10.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我相守
Dialogue: 1,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.54,0:18:15.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,易瑞娜
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.72,0:18:19.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不要把持着新娘了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.51,0:18:21.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 恭喜 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.00,0:18:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.54,0:18:27.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有家族闹剧 哪叫婚礼？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.91,0:18:30.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 这开了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.40,0:18:33.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,大家好
Dialogue: 1,0:18:36.85,0:18:39.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要举杯敬酒
Dialogue: 1,0:18:39.12,0:18:40.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,敬我的新弟妹
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.59,0:18:45.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉 我希望你在过去的18年里睡眠充足
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.46,0:18:47.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你可能有一阵子没法好好睡了
Dialogue: 1,0:18:53.52,0:18:56.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉和大家一样
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.25,0:18:59.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,完全迷上了爱德华
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.01,0:19:02.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者说"头发" 这是我给他起的外号
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.26,0:19:08.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,突然之间 爱德华爱上了贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.58,0:19:13.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,尽管她不是排球队队长
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.97,0:19:15.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是开开玩笑
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.88,0:19:17.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,也不是学生会主席
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.95,0:19:19.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德华会是一个好丈夫
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.63,0:19:23.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这个是因为…
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.89,0:19:25.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是警察
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.12,0:19:27.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么都知道
Dialogue: 1,0:19:28.51,0:19:31.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,比如怎么抓捕犯人
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.35,0:19:33.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,追到天涯海角
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.84,0:19:35.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,既然你是我的姐姐
Dialogue: 1,0:19:36.31,0:19:39.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就得克服对时装的反感
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.27,0:19:41.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道怎么用枪
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.32,0:19:44.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,短裙 高跟鞋和手袋
Dialogue: 1,0:19:45.36,0:19:48.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,睡吧 我的宝贝
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.99,0:19:51.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,睡吧
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.93,0:19:55.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,当你醒来
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.17,0:19:58.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会看见我
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.66,0:20:00.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想要谢谢蕾妮和查理
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.98,0:20:03.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,让这么出色的人来到人世间
Dialogue: 1,0:20:04.34,0:20:05.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,带到我们的生命中
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.01,0:20:08.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会永远珍惜 保护她
Dialogue: 1,0:20:08.78,0:20:10.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,非同寻常的是
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.60,0:20:15.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,能遇见一个你能敞开心扉的人
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.18,0:20:18.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会接受你的一切
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.44,0:20:25.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我等待了很长的时间
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.91,0:20:29.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,才能够超越自我
Dialogue: 1,0:20:30.93,0:20:33.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,有了贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.76,0:20:36.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,我才感到人生终于可以开始了
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.44,0:20:45.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,在此向我美丽的新娘敬酒
Dialogue: 1,0:20:48.23,0:20:51.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟你在一起的时光永远嫌不够
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.06,0:20:56.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,但让我们从"永恒"开始
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.12,0:21:27.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还有一份礼物刚到
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.43,0:21:29.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.98,0:21:31.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我来…
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.75,0:21:34.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么婚礼礼物会在这里？
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.34,0:21:37.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样比较隐密一点
Dialogue: 1,0:21:38.26,0:21:40.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,伴郎还没时间准备燕尾服
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.75,0:21:42.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅各布
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.10,0:21:46.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅各布
Dialogue: 1,0:21:48.32,0:21:49.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.52,0:21:53.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 贝拉 - 嘿
Dialogue: 1,0:21:54.01,0:21:55.33,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是好人
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.36,0:21:56.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,人好是我的座右铭
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.08,0:22:04.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看看罗莎莉想不想跳舞
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.85,0:22:07.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起迟到了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:07.25,0:22:08.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.79,0:22:12.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在一切都很好
Dialogue: 1,0:22:14.41,0:22:16.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,想要跟我跳支舞吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:28.29,0:22:29.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你去哪里了？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.32,0:22:34.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,们都要张贴寻人启事了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:34.80,0:22:36.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,大多数时间在加拿大北部
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.15,0:22:39.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想是这样
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.57,0:22:42.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,能够重新直立行走真是奇怪
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.18,0:22:44.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,还穿着衣服
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.20,0:22:48.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很久没有过人的生活了
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.17,0:22:52.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你现在在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.15,0:22:55.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,还好吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.02,0:23:02.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么？怕我踢场子啊？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.31,0:23:13.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,又不是只有你一个
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.87,0:23:19.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,你该认为我现在已经习惯和你说再见了
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.25,0:23:26.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,哭的人不该是你 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.75,0:23:33.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,谁在结婚时不掉泪
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.49,0:23:37.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样我会只记得哭泣的你
Dialogue: 1,0:23:38.61,0:23:40.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,粉红的脸蛋
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.76,0:23:44.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,笨手笨脚
Dialogue: 1,0:23:49.54,0:23:51.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,心跳
Dialogue: 1,0:23:53.61,0:23:56.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以很快地你就不再当我是活人？
Dialogue: 1,0:23:56.56,0:23:57.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 1,0:24:08.09,0:24:09.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,0:24:09.87,0:24:13.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是很珍惜你身为人类的最后一晚
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.01,0:24:16.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是我的最后一夜
Dialogue: 1,0:24:19.73,0:24:22.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？我以为你
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.00,0:24:27.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想我的蜜月在痛苦中渡过
Dialogue: 1,0:24:27.64,0:24:29.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么意思？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:30.80,0:24:34.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,反正跟他一起又不会有个真正的蜜月之旅
Dialogue: 1,0:24:35.12,0:24:37.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,会和任何其它蜜月一样真实
Dialogue: 1,0:24:37.24,0:24:38.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么玩笑话
Dialogue: 1,0:24:40.06,0:24:41.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑吧？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.50,0:24:45.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？在你还是人类之身时蜜月？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:45.20,0:24:48.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不是认真的 贝拉 告诉我你没那么傻？
Dialogue: 1,0:24:49.79,0:24:51.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的不关你的事
Dialogue: 1,0:24:51.99,0:24:54.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不 你不能这么做 - 杰克…
Dialogue: 1,0:24:54.31,0:24:56.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 听我说 贝拉 - 放开我
Dialogue: 1,0:24:56.84,0:24:58.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅克布 冷静一点
Dialogue: 1,0:24:58.74,0:25:00.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？你会杀了她
Dialogue: 1,0:25:01.46,0:25:03.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 走开
Dialogue: 1,0:25:08.17,0:25:09.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,够了 雅各布
Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.18,0:25:11.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你别管 山姆
Dialogue: 1,0:25:11.82,0:25:13.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,别闯祸了让我们帮你擦屁股
Dialogue: 1,0:25:13.79,0:25:16.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她会死的 - 这不关我们的事了
Dialogue: 1,0:25:36.03,0:25:37.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧 赛斯
Dialogue: 1,0:25:42.63,0:25:45.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我真傻 - 不 没关系
Dialogue: 1,0:25:47.20,0:25:49.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们可能惦记我们了 我们回去吧
Dialogue: 1,0:26:10.77,0:26:13.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不肯告诉你他要带你去哪里？
Dialogue: 1,0:26:13.74,0:26:15.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊 他想给我惊喜
Dialogue: 1,0:26:18.36,0:26:22.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,好 戴上帽子 涂涂防晒霜
Dialogue: 1,0:26:22.39,0:26:25.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 小心点 - 我会的
Dialogue: 1,0:26:26.22,0:26:27.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:26:29.91,0:26:31.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:26:31.81,0:26:33.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也爱你
Dialogue: 1,0:26:34.02,0:26:35.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,非常爱
Dialogue: 1,0:26:44.05,0:26:45.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,0:26:52.97,0:26:55.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,东西都打包好了 随时可以出发
Dialogue: 1,0:26:55.46,0:26:56.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 1,0:27:02.86,0:27:05.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我去看他 - 好的
Dialogue: 1,0:27:15.87,0:27:17.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,老爸…
Dialogue: 1,0:27:21.50,0:27:22.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:27:24.80,0:27:26.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,可能会比较奇怪
Dialogue: 1,0:27:28.28,0:27:30.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不住在我这里了
Dialogue: 1,0:27:31.54,0:27:32.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 1,0:27:33.13,0:27:35.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也会觉得奇怪
Dialogue: 1,0:27:38.47,0:27:41.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道这里永远是你的家 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:27:49.76,0:27:51.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你 爸爸
Dialogue: 1,0:27:51.47,0:27:53.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,永远
Dialogue: 1,0:27:58.89,0:28:00.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也爱你 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:28:01.10,0:28:03.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,一直爱 永远爱
Dialogue: 1,0:28:09.56,0:28:11.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,0:28:14.73,0:28:17.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧 别赶不上飞机
Dialogue: 1,0:28:17.84,0:28:19.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管是去哪里
Dialogue: 1,0:28:23.85,0:28:25.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:28:27.34,0:28:28.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 1,0:28:33.39,0:28:34.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好了？
Dialogue: 1,0:28:55.74,0:28:56.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 1,0:30:03.06,0:30:05.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,[葡萄牙语] 请靠边停车
Dialogue: 1,0:30:45.29,0:30:47.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们不住在里约热内卢？
Dialogue: 1,0:30:47.81,0:30:49.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 只是路过
Dialogue: 1,0:30:50.01,0:30:51.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,快到了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:31:08.12,0:31:09.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是埃斯梅岛
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.20,0:31:12.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是卡莱尔的礼物
Dialogue: 1,0:31:27.98,0:31:30.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的有必要吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:31:31.14,0:31:33.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果不传统就不是我了
Dialogue: 1,0:31:48.18,0:31:49.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,要四处转转吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:39.76,0:32:41.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你累吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:47.53,0:32:49.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,想游泳吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:32:49.64,0:32:51.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,听上去不错
Dialogue: 1,0:32:59.49,0:33:01.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,身为人类 我需要几分钟准备一下
Dialogue: 1,0:33:08.21,0:33:10.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,别拖太久 卡伦太太
Dialogue: 1,0:33:13.37,0:33:14.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:33:35.69,0:33:37.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 1,0:34:14.07,0:34:15.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝
Dialogue: 1,0:34:37.68,0:34:39.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,别做胆小鬼
Dialogue: 1,0:35:32.49,0:35:34.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真漂亮
Dialogue: 1,0:35:54.67,0:35:56.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,我答应我们可以试试
Dialogue: 1,0:35:58.23,0:36:00.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,但是如果不成功
Dialogue: 1,0:36:01.29,0:36:03.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我信任你
Dialogue: 1,0:36:49.68,0:36:50.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 1,0:38:39.98,0:38:41.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉 你受伤了
Dialogue: 1,0:38:44.31,0:38:45.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:38:55.21,0:38:56.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 贝拉 看
Dialogue: 1,0:39:07.16,0:39:09.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 1,0:39:23.88,0:39:25.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有
Dialogue: 1,0:39:25.86,0:39:27.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,真的 我没有 我很好
Dialogue: 1,0:39:28.02,0:39:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,别说你很好
Dialogue: 1,0:39:30.97,0:39:32.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 1,0:39:33.00,0:39:34.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 1,0:39:35.11,0:39:36.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,别扫兴
Dialogue: 1,0:39:36.47,0:39:38.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,我已经扫兴了
Dialogue: 1,0:39:41.45,0:39:44.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,你难道看不出我有多快乐吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:39:45.49,0:39:47.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者说 五秒钟之前是这样
Dialogue: 1,0:39:49.71,0:39:51.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在我真的有点生气了
Dialogue: 1,0:39:51.78,0:39:53.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该对我生气
Dialogue: 1,0:39:55.65,0:39:56.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们知道这很蹊跷
Dialogue: 1,0:39:57.60,0:40:00.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认为我们做的很棒
Dialogue: 1,0:40:04.29,0:40:06.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,对我来说很棒
Dialogue: 1,0:40:07.28,0:40:08.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就是你所担心的？
Dialogue: 1,0:40:09.64,0:40:11.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,怕我不开心？
Dialogue: 1,0:40:14.74,0:40:16.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道对你来说不同 但
Dialogue: 1,0:40:19.21,0:40:20.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,对人来说
Dialogue: 1,0:40:20.90,0:40:23.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想不出还有什么比这更好了
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.41,0:40:31.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,昨晚是我有生以来最美好的夜晚
Dialogue: 1,0:40:36.53,0:40:38.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,是最美好的
Dialogue: 1,0:40:56.53,0:40:57.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会再碰我 是吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:41:03.44,0:41:05.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我不是这个意思
Dialogue: 1,0:41:05.89,0:41:07.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来为你做早餐吧
Dialogue: 1,0:43:21.89,0:43:22.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,我赢了
Dialogue: 1,0:43:37.74,0:43:39.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:43:42.86,0:43:44.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你做恶梦了？
Dialogue: 1,0:43:45.19,0:43:46.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 1,0:43:55.39,0:43:57.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是一个梦
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.34,0:44:01.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,一个很美的梦
Dialogue: 1,0:44:01.58,0:44:03.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,那你为什么哭呢？
Dialogue: 1,0:44:04.77,0:44:07.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我希望它是真实的
Dialogue: 1,0:44:08.72,0:44:10.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我
Dialogue: 1,0:44:16.37,0:44:17.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉 我不能
Dialogue: 1,0:44:21.60,0:44:23.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 1,0:44:25.30,0:44:26.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 1,0:45:00.39,0:45:02.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许他们会说她遇上车祸了
Dialogue: 1,0:45:03.69,0:45:05.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,或者失足从悬崖摔落
Dialogue: 1,0:45:13.91,0:45:15.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少我能想明白一点
Dialogue: 1,0:45:17.65,0:45:19.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能
Dialogue: 1,0:45:20.73,0:45:23.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡伦一家对小镇或部落没有危险
Dialogue: 1,0:45:24.43,0:45:26.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,他会杀了她或把她变成吸血鬼
Dialogue: 1,0:45:26.90,0:45:30.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 约定里说 - 是我说的 雅各布
Dialogue: 1,0:45:30.55,0:45:31.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,我说的
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.68,0:45:41.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要想事态有所改变 你就该采取行动
Dialogue: 1,0:45:44.44,0:45:46.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在看来拒绝是个好办法
Dialogue: 1,0:45:47.68,0:45:51.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 你真的觉得如果贝拉回来变成吸血鬼 你会杀她吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.13,0:45:54.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会 他会让我们其中一个动手 然后怨恨…
Dialogue: 1,0:45:54.58,0:45:55.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,住嘴 莉娅
Dialogue: 1,0:45:55.90,0:45:57.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,你就不能忘了她吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.69,0:45:59.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和她又不是命中注定
Dialogue: 1,0:46:02.26,0:46:03.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少他们看上去很幸福
Dialogue: 1,0:46:06.16,0:46:07.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 有些人就是幸运
Dialogue: 1,0:46:08.16,0:46:09.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,幸运？
Dialogue: 1,0:46:11.04,0:46:13.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们都不再属于自己了
Dialogue: 1,0:46:13.79,0:46:15.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,最恶心的部分是
Dialogue: 1,0:46:15.96,0:46:17.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的基因告诉他们自己很幸福
Dialogue: 1,0:46:19.82,0:46:22.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少当你爱上其他人 你就会把贝拉忘记的
Dialogue: 1,0:46:26.66,0:46:29.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是说 只要快乐 总好过
Dialogue: 1,0:46:29.15,0:46:32.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,为一个得不到的人而伤心
Dialogue: 1,0:46:50.12,0:46:52.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉 这两位是我们的管家 古斯塔沃和卡拉
Dialogue: 1,0:46:53.26,0:46:55.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我妻子贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:46:55.73,0:46:56.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴认识您
Dialogue: 1,0:47:00.86,0:47:02.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我们该随他们去
Dialogue: 1,0:47:08.37,0:47:09.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是为什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:09.84,0:47:11.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,她怕你
Dialogue: 1,0:47:11.96,0:47:13.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:14.87,0:47:17.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我和你一个人在这里
Dialogue: 1,0:47:19.20,0:47:20.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 她知道你的事？
Dialogue: 1,0:47:21.43,0:47:23.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,她怀疑
Dialogue: 1,0:47:24.30,0:47:25.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,她是提卡纳土著
Dialogue: 1,0:47:25.64,0:47:28.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们的传说有讲到吸血恶魔
Dialogue: 1,0:47:28.07,0:47:31.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,专门诱骗漂亮女人
Dialogue: 1,0:47:34.31,0:47:35.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,恶魔
Dialogue: 1,0:48:09.41,0:48:12.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我去内陆狩猎了 会在你醒来之前回来
Dialogue: 1,0:48:12.41,0:48:14.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你动作太慢了
Dialogue: 1,0:49:11.92,0:49:12.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:49:14.80,0:49:16.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,别进来
Dialogue: 1,0:49:18.24,0:49:19.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不该看到这个
Dialogue: 1,0:49:20.32,0:49:23.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,无论疾病或健康 还记得吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:24.76,0:49:26.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,一定是因为鸡肉
Dialogue: 1,0:49:26.67,0:49:28.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能把我的包拿过来吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:45.17,0:49:45.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:49.87,0:49:52.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,婚礼过去几天了？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:52.87,0:49:54.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,14天 怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:57.43,0:49:58.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能告诉我怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:49:58.64,0:50:02.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来晚了
Dialogue: 1,0:50:02.97,0:50:05.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的大姨妈来晚了
Dialogue: 1,0:50:21.97,0:50:23.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不可能
Dialogue: 1,0:50:26.96,0:50:28.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,这种事会发生吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:46.96,0:50:48.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爱丽丝 - 贝拉 你还好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:50.57,0:50:53.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不确定 - 为什么？出什么问题了？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:53.57,0:50:54.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我刚… - 你刚什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:50:56.97,0:50:58.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 爱丽丝 你看到什么？- 我是卡莱尔
Dialogue: 1,0:50:58.29,0:51:00.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉 发生什么事？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:00.96,0:51:03.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,我有点担心 吸血鬼也会震惊吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:03.47,0:51:05.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 有人受伤了？- 没有
Dialogue: 1,0:51:08.40,0:51:13.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道不可能 但我觉得我怀孕了
Dialogue: 1,0:51:19.02,0:51:23.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 我发誓我身体内刚才有东西在动
Dialogue: 1,0:51:25.77,0:51:28.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 这有可能吗？- 我不知道
Dialogue: 1,0:51:29.25,0:51:30.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,他说什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:30.59,0:51:33.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,她越快回来 我们就能越快找到原因
Dialogue: 1,0:51:33.12,0:51:35.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我要你马上回到内陆 - 我会的
Dialogue: 1,0:51:40.85,0:51:43.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 1,0:51:53.28,0:51:55.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 1,0:51:55.90,0:51:57.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡拉想确保你是不是还活着
Dialogue: 1,0:53:13.74,0:53:15.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,你对她做了什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:53:16.90,0:53:18.73,CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道些什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:53:19.65,0:53:22.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你是个魔鬼
Dialogue: 1,0:53:22.78,0:53:25.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,你杀了这个小姑娘
Dialogue: 1,0:53:26.36,0:53:27.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,说什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:53:28.52,0:53:30.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,人们由他们自己的传说 你已经看到了
Dialogue: 1,0:53:30.94,0:53:33.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了 告诉我该如何救她
Dialogue: 1,0:53:34.10,0:53:36.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你只会做坏事
Dialogue: 1,0:53:36.28,0:53:37.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在求你
Dialogue: 1,0:53:38.15,0:53:40.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么都愿意
Dialogue: 1,0:53:40.60,0:53:42.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱她
Dialogue: 1,0:53:44.01,0:53:44.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 1,0:53:45.81,0:53:47.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我她怎样才能活下去
Dialogue: 1,0:54:19.32,0:54:20.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,死亡
Dialogue: 1,0:54:36.78,0:54:38.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会让它伤害你的
Dialogue: 1,0:54:41.00,0:54:43.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔会把那个东西弄出来
Dialogue: 1,0:54:55.64,0:54:57.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,"东西"？
Dialogue: 1,0:55:20.79,0:55:22.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们装东西的时候你等在这儿
Dialogue: 1,0:55:48.58,0:55:50.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 罗莎莉
Dialogue: 1,0:55:50.77,0:55:51.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉
Dialogue: 1,0:55:53.87,0:55:58.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 怎么啦？- 我需要你的帮助
Dialogue: 1,0:56:23.50,0:56:25.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 孩子
Dialogue: 1,0:56:25.57,0:56:26.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么啦？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:26.47,0:56:28.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉给他打电话了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:31.73,0:56:35.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿 我有一阵子没见你了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:35.40,0:56:38.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗？- 你终于有贝拉的消息了？
Dialogue: 1,0:56:40.61,0:56:42.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们延长了行程
Dialogue: 1,0:56:42.66,0:56:44.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,她好像感染了病毒
Dialogue: 1,0:56:44.18,0:56:46.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们想等她感觉好些再出发
Dialogue: 1,0:56:46.80,0:56:48.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,她病了
Dialogue: 1,0:56:49.58,0:56:51.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 她叫我不要担心 但她听上去
Dialogue: 1,0:56:54.33,0:56:57.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道 她有点心不在焉
Dialogue: 1,0:56:57.88,0:56:59.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,她会没事的 查理
Dialogue: 1,0:57:00.62,0:57:02.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧 吃饭
Dialogue: 1,0:57:13.60,0:57:14.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅各布
Dialogue: 1,0:57:15.31,0:57:16.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,别管了
Dialogue: 1,0:57:36.36,0:57:39.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 嘿 雅各布 你好吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:57:39.24,0:57:42.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 跟我说实话
Dialogue: 1,0:57:42.46,0:57:44.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 是你吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:57:45.02,0:57:48.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 她在这里？- 他们两周前回来的
Dialogue: 1,0:57:49.76,0:57:50.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 1,0:58:10.80,0:58:12.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我很高兴你能来
Dialogue: 1,0:58:15.07,0:58:17.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 够近了 - 关你什么事？
Dialogue: 1,0:58:18.89,0:58:20.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,露丝 没关系
Dialogue: 1,0:58:31.07,0:58:32.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,你看上去真糟糕
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.62,0:58:38.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我也很高兴见到你
Dialogue: 1,0:58:42.21,0:58:45.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能告诉我你怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:58:48.56,0:58:49.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,露丝 你能扶我起来吗？
Dialogue: 1,0:59:08.20,0:59:09.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干的好事
Dialogue: 1,0:59:10.92,0:59:12.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我根本不知道会有可能
Dialogue: 1,0:59:12.89,0:59:14.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 是什么？- 我不确定
Dialogue: 1,0:59:14.87,0:59:18.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,超声波和针都无法穿透胚胎
Dialogue: 1,0:59:18.72,0:59:19.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也看不到
Dialogue: 1,0:59:21.77,0:59:24.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也无法再看到贝拉的未来
Dialogue: 1,0:59:24.66,0:59:27.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们研究了传说 但是没有太多线索
Dialogue: 1,0:59:27.34,0:59:30.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们所知道的是它很结实 长得很快
Dialogue: 1,0:59:31.41,0:59:32.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们为什么不能做点什么？
Dialogue: 1,0:59:32.66,0:59:33.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,把它从她身体内取出来
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.62,0:59:36.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不关你的事 狗
Dialogue: 1,0:59:36.27,0:59:37.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,露丝
Dialogue: 1,0:59:37.75,0:59:41.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 吵架对贝拉没有好处 - 这个胎儿对贝拉没有好处
Dialogue: 1,0:59:41.79,0:59:46.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 叫它"宝宝" 它只是个小宝宝
Dialogue: 1,0:59:47.18,0:59:48.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,有可能
Dialogue: 1,0:59:50.44,0:59:52.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 你需要做点什么
Dialogue: 1,0:59:52.83,0:59:54.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 1,0:59:54.94,0:59:57.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是他的决定 也不是你们任何人的
Dialogue: 1,0:59:57.51,0:59:59.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅各布 我需要和你谈谈
Dialogue: 1,1:00:10.59,1:00:12.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我就知道你会毁了她
Dialogue: 1,1:00:15.93,1:00:18.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,她认为卡莱尔能够在最后一刻改变她
Dialogue: 1,1:00:19.42,1:00:21.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像他对我和Esme所做的一样
Dialogue: 1,1:00:21.18,1:00:26.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他可以吗？- 可能性很小
Dialogue: 1,1:00:28.38,1:00:30.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果她心力衰竭
Dialogue: 1,1:00:36.38,1:00:39.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,听着 雅各布 我需要你帮我做件事
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.36,1:00:43.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,为她呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:00:46.32,1:00:50.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,你和她的关系是我永远无法理解的
Dialogue: 1,1:00:50.89,1:00:52.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许你可以和她谈
Dialogue: 1,1:00:52.79,1:00:54.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,让她回心转意
Dialogue: 1,1:00:55.64,1:00:57.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能让她活下来
Dialogue: 1,1:00:59.28,1:01:01.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果我做不到呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:03.98,1:01:05.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果她死了
Dialogue: 1,1:01:09.64,1:01:11.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以如愿以偿
Dialogue: 1,1:01:13.24,1:01:15.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,杀了我
Dialogue: 1,1:01:25.71,1:01:28.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,露丝 我很好 真的
Dialogue: 1,1:01:47.76,1:01:49.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德华派你来和我谈的？
Dialogue: 1,1:01:49.72,1:01:51.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,算是吧
Dialogue: 1,1:01:51.07,1:01:53.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我不知道他为什么以为你会听我的
Dialogue: 1,1:01:53.73,1:01:55.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,你以前从来没听过
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.69,1:02:06.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始和那个金发女人成了好朋友啦？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:06.11,1:02:08.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,露丝明白我想要什么
Dialogue: 1,1:02:13.04,1:02:15.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在想什么 贝拉？
Dialogue: 1,1:02:15.77,1:02:17.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 1,1:02:17.52,1:02:19.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道这件事看起来挺可怕 但是…
Dialogue: 1,1:02:20.97,1:02:23.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,但并非如此
Dialogue: 1,1:02:24.56,1:02:26.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,这就像个奇迹
Dialogue: 1,1:02:28.14,1:02:29.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我能感觉到他
Dialogue: 1,1:02:30.06,1:02:33.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,那么说是个活蹦乱跳的小男孩了
Dialogue: 1,1:02:33.68,1:02:36.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 我不知道 我本该带些蓝气球来
Dialogue: 1,1:02:36.44,1:02:37.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是猜测
Dialogue: 1,1:02:39.12,1:02:41.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,我在脑子里想的时候 看到的是一个男孩
Dialogue: 1,1:02:43.32,1:02:45.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,到时看吧
Dialogue: 1,1:02:45.43,1:02:49.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 杰克 我可以做得到
Dialogue: 1,1:02:50.19,1:02:53.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我够坚强 - 拜托
Dialogue: 1,1:02:54.62,1:02:58.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你可以和你那吸血鬼去编这瞎话 但你骗不了我
Dialogue: 1,1:02:58.71,1:03:01.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道那东西会对你做什么
Dialogue: 1,1:03:01.36,1:03:04.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 它会杀了你 贝拉 - 你错了
Dialogue: 1,1:03:04.76,1:03:08.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,当你死的时候 还有什么意义？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:08.23,1:03:10.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你 你爱他
Dialogue: 1,1:03:10.43,1:03:12.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,这对大家有什么好？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:12.71,1:03:14.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为我显然看不懂
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.57,1:03:24.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:03:25.34,1:03:26.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 1,1:03:26.98,1:03:29.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要这么做
Dialogue: 1,1:03:30.47,1:03:32.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,活下来 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:03:32.83,1:03:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 1,1:03:34.90,1:03:38.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 不会有事的
Dialogue: 1,1:03:50.83,1:03:52.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 别走
Dialogue: 1,1:03:53.08,1:03:55.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道结局会是怎样
Dialogue: 1,1:03:58.22,1:03:59.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想眼睁睁看着
Dialogue: 1,1:04:37.29,1:04:39.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 我能做得到
Dialogue: 1,1:04:43.58,1:04:45.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不关你的事 狗
Dialogue: 1,1:04:45.53,1:04:48.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 别走
Dialogue: 1,1:04:48.26,1:04:49.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你干的
Dialogue: 1,1:04:50.05,1:04:51.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都会好的
Dialogue: 1,1:04:51.83,1:04:53.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,胎儿对贝拉没有好处
Dialogue: 1,1:04:54.08,1:04:55.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道结局会是怎样
Dialogue: 1,1:04:56.65,1:04:58.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,它会杀了你
Dialogue: 1,1:05:24.80,1:05:26.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.01,1:05:46.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,是真的吗 雅各布？
Dialogue: 1,1:05:46.55,1:05:47.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,它长得很快
Dialogue: 1,1:05:48.08,1:05:49.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不正常
Dialogue: 1,1:05:49.16,1:05:49.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 1,1:05:50.10,1:05:50.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,怪物 孽障
Dialogue: 1,1:05:51.43,1:05:53.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,在我们的领地上
Dialogue: 1,1:05:53.63,1:05:57.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们决不容忍
Dialogue: 1,1:05:58.21,1:05:59.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须保护部落
Dialogue: 1,1:06:00.12,1:06:03.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们产下的东西将无法抵御饥渴
Dialogue: 1,1:06:03.66,1:06:05.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,所有的人类都将处于危险之中
Dialogue: 1,1:06:06.03,1:06:07.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们准备好了 - 我们马上出发
Dialogue: 1,1:06:08.41,1:06:09.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 1,1:06:09.57,1:06:13.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们必须在它出生前消灭它
Dialogue: 1,1:06:13.28,1:06:15.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的意思是杀死贝拉？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:15.32,1:06:17.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,她的选择影响了我们所有人
Dialogue: 1,1:06:17.11,1:06:20.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉是人类 我们也要保护她
Dialogue: 1,1:06:20.35,1:06:21.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,她反正都要死
Dialogue: 1,1:06:26.60,1:06:28.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚我们要和真正的敌人战斗
Dialogue: 1,1:06:28.97,1:06:32.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚？
Dialogue: 1,1:06:33.53,1:06:37.43,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要和我们并肩作战 杰克
Dialogue: 1,1:06:55.47,1:06:59.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不
Dialogue: 1,1:07:00.40,1:07:03.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是伊弗雷姆 布莱克的孙子
Dialogue: 1,1:07:04.46,1:07:07.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,我是酋长的孙子
Dialogue: 1,1:07:08.36,1:07:12.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,我生来就不为追随你或任何其他人的
Dialogue: 1,1:07:51.30,1:07:53.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,别担心 没人跟着我们
Dialogue: 1,1:07:53.23,1:07:54.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:07:54.49,1:07:57.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我离开山姆的队伍了 - 回家吧 塞斯
Dialogue: 1,1:07:57.11,1:07:59.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我不要跟在他后面 - 不 你要跟
Dialogue: 1,1:08:00.84,1:08:02.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是开玩笑 快离开这里
Dialogue: 1,1:08:03.18,1:08:05.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是命令吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:05.92,1:08:07.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,想要我也俯首帖耳？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:08.08,1:08:09.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不对任何人下命令
Dialogue: 1,1:08:10.97,1:08:13.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要一个人去 行吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:13.44,1:08:14.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 1,1:08:14.62,1:08:17.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我给你掩护 - 不可以
Dialogue: 1,1:08:19.55,1:08:21.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果山姆要抓贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:08:21.39,1:08:24.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的已经准备好迎战你的兄弟？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:25.07,1:08:26.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,还有姐妹？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:27.97,1:08:29.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果这样做是对的话
Dialogue: 1,1:08:33.97,1:08:35.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,随你便
Dialogue: 1,1:08:35.98,1:08:38.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要去提醒卡伦一家
Dialogue: 1,1:08:38.27,1:08:40.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,你自便吧
Dialogue: 1,1:08:44.97,1:08:46.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,这该多棒啊？
Dialogue: 1,1:08:46.97,1:08:48.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,两个人
Dialogue: 1,1:08:48.77,1:08:50.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 与全世界为敌 - 别把我惹毛了 塞斯
Dialogue: 1,1:08:51.20,1:08:52.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我住嘴
Dialogue: 1,1:08:52.59,1:08:54.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,我做得到
Dialogue: 1,1:08:58.39,1:08:59.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,准备好
Dialogue: 1,1:09:00.97,1:09:02.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们来找贝拉了
Dialogue: 1,1:09:05.31,1:09:06.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们别想碰她一根毫毛
Dialogue: 1,1:09:07.26,1:09:08.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,同意
Dialogue: 1,1:09:14.90,1:09:16.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪 我大老远就能闻到他们的味道了
Dialogue: 1,1:09:17.28,1:09:19.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们在这里干什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:19.49,1:09:21.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不想让我弟弟自寻死路
Dialogue: 1,1:09:21.49,1:09:24.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,走开 莉娅 我能照顾好自己
Dialogue: 1,1:09:24.15,1:09:26.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真想证明给你姐看
Dialogue: 1,1:09:26.07,1:09:27.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们两个都住嘴行吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:09:30.64,1:09:33.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 山姆派你来的？- 山姆根本不知道我走了
Dialogue: 1,1:09:38.50,1:09:40.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,我猜他刚刚发觉了
Dialogue: 1,1:09:41.97,1:09:43.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 1,1:09:44.90,1:09:46.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道他的计划
Dialogue: 1,1:09:47.57,1:09:49.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,山姆没法出其不意了
Dialogue: 1,1:09:49.27,1:09:51.66,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不想在数量上压倒你们
Dialogue: 1,1:09:51.67,1:09:52.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,所以他不会与你们正面交战
Dialogue: 1,1:09:52.83,1:09:56.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,他包围了这个地方 准备伺机出击
Dialogue: 1,1:09:56.74,1:09:57.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,他不打硬仗是进不来的
Dialogue: 1,1:09:57.58,1:09:58.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要硬仗
Dialogue: 1,1:09:59.01,1:10:02.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我们不想破坏约定 - 约定无效
Dialogue: 1,1:10:03.04,1:10:05.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 至少山姆是这么认为的 - 我们不这么认为
Dialogue: 1,1:10:05.85,1:10:08.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 没有人可以被追猎数周
Dialogue: 1,1:10:10.57,1:10:11.45,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们可以应付
Dialogue: 1,1:10:15.50,1:10:17.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你已经帮了我们大忙了 雅各布
Dialogue: 1,1:10:17.44,1:10:18.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 1,1:10:48.44,1:10:50.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道他们就在附近
Dialogue: 1,1:10:51.17,1:10:53.89,CHS,,0,0,0,,但我已经没听到他们的声音了
Dialogue: 1,1:10:55.70,1:10:57.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,好安静
Dialogue: 1,1:10:58.86,1:10:59.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,就在我决定离开的时候
Dialogue: 1,1:10:59.78,1:11:02.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也没听到他们的声音了
Dialogue: 1,1:11:03.57,1:11:05.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 1,1:11:07.76,1:11:09.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你知道你不能留在这里 - 可我没有地方
Dialogue: 1,1:11:09.83,1:11:11.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能相信你对卡伦一家的态度
Dialogue: 1,1:11:11.57,1:11:13.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你太恨他们了
Dialogue: 1,1:11:15.34,1:11:17.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你甚至不喜欢我 - 我没这必要
Dialogue: 1,1:11:19.02,1:11:20.85,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只要跟着你们
Dialogue: 1,1:11:22.38,1:11:24.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,塞斯不要你在这里
Dialogue: 1,1:11:25.11,1:11:27.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不想
Dialogue: 1,1:11:29.77,1:11:33.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,没人要对我来说不是什么稀奇事
Dialogue: 1,1:11:49.68,1:11:51.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会碍你们的事
Dialogue: 1,1:11:52.21,1:11:55.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会照你说的去做 只要不让我回到山姆的队伍
Dialogue: 1,1:11:55.19,1:11:58.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,做他无法摆脱的可怜的前女友
Dialogue: 1,1:11:59.07,1:12:03.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,你不知道我有多少次希望我能将某个人铭刻在心
Dialogue: 1,1:12:04.31,1:12:07.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,任何人
Dialogue: 1,1:12:08.12,1:12:09.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,只是不要跟太紧
Dialogue: 1,1:12:24.37,1:12:26.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 1,1:12:28.46,1:12:30.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要四处巡视一下
Dialogue: 1,1:12:30.63,1:12:32.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,一起去吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:13:47.67,1:13:49.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,她的肋骨裂开了
Dialogue: 1,1:13:49.82,1:13:52.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,但没有裂成碎片
Dialogue: 1,1:13:52.83,1:13:54.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,它没有刺穿任何东西
Dialogue: 1,1:13:54.84,1:13:56.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 目前还没有 - 爱德华
Dialogue: 1,1:13:58.67,1:14:01.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,它现在正在破坏她的骨头
Dialogue: 1,1:14:02.35,1:14:04.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,它从里面向外挤压着你
Dialogue: 1,1:14:05.86,1:14:08.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 把你和我说的也告诉她吧
Dialogue: 1,1:14:09.37,1:14:10.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉她
Dialogue: 1,1:14:12.67,1:14:14.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 告诉我
Dialogue: 1,1:14:15.06,1:14:16.64,CHS,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 1,1:14:26.36,1:14:29.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的身体容不下这个胎儿
Dialogue: 1,1:14:31.37,1:14:33.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,它太强壮了
Dialogue: 1,1:14:33.59,1:14:35.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,它让你无法获得你所需的营养
Dialogue: 1,1:14:36.53,1:14:40.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,它会让你慢慢饿死 我无法阻止 也无法让它放慢速度
Dialogue: 1,1:14:43.21,1:14:46.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,按照这个速度 你的心脏在你临产前就会停止跳动
Dialogue: 1,1:14:49.92,1:14:53.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那我就尽力坚持 - 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:14:54.38,1:14:57.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,有些情况是连吸血鬼的毒液也无法克服的
Dialogue: 1,1:14:58.61,1:15:00.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,你明白吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:15:01.31,1:15:01.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 1,1:15:14.47,1:15:17.63,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 爱德华
Dialogue: 1,1:15:17.87,1:15:19.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能没有你
Dialogue: 1,1:15:20.19,1:15:22.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,不会的 我会留下我的骨肉
Dialogue: 1,1:15:22.81,1:15:24.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,他需要你
Dialogue: 1,1:15:24.62,1:15:26.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真的认为我能够爱它
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.57,1:15:29.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,或容忍它 如果它害死你的话？
Dialogue: 1,1:15:30.95,1:15:32.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,这不是他的错
Dialogue: 1,1:15:33.60,1:15:37.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你必须接受它 - 因为你没有给我选择
Dialogue: 1,1:15:38.23,1:15:41.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉 我们应该相依为命的 还记得吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:15:41.90,1:15:44.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,但这一次你却自作主张
Dialogue: 1,1:15:44.68,1:15:46.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你选择了离开我
Dialogue: 1,1:15:46.17,1:15:49.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 别这么想 - 我只能这么想
Dialogue: 1,1:15:49.52,1:15:50.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,因为失去你的人是我
Dialogue: 1,1:15:51.48,1:15:52.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,而这不是我的选择
Dialogue: 1,1:15:54.71,1:15:55.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是我的选择
Dialogue: 1,1:16:57.69,1:16:59.02,CHS,,0,0,0,,你冷吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:16:59.67,1:17:01.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:17:08.63,1:17:10.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要这样
Dialogue: 1,1:17:11.05,1:17:11.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:17:12.39,1:17:16.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,不要那样微笑 仿佛我是你在这世界上最喜欢的人
Dialogue: 1,1:17:16.14,1:17:18.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,你是其中的一个
Dialogue: 1,1:17:20.74,1:17:23.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,有你在感觉很充实 杰克
Dialogue: 1,1:17:37.43,1:17:40.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们要想办法让她的胃吸收些东西
Dialogue: 1,1:17:42.36,1:17:44.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 只要我能看到胎儿的话 - 宝宝
Dialogue: 1,1:17:44.04,1:17:48.42,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许我就能知道它想要什么
Dialogue: 1,1:17:53.86,1:17:56.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,我认为你可能说得对
Dialogue: 1,1:17:56.76,1:17:58.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅各布倒是有个主意
Dialogue: 1,1:18:00.71,1:18:03.46,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是什么主意 只是个恶毒的意见
Dialogue: 1,1:18:04.50,1:18:05.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,你在想什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:06.37,1:18:09.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,也许它只是想要用牙齿咬着什么人
Dialogue: 1,1:18:20.27,1:18:21.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,他渴了？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:23.77,1:18:25.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道那种感觉
Dialogue: 1,1:18:25.82,1:18:29.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果它渴了的话 它不会想要动物的血
Dialogue: 1,1:18:29.45,1:18:31.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,我给贝拉留了一些O型阴性血
Dialogue: 1,1:18:33.94,1:18:36.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,和我去走走吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:56.53,1:18:59.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等 你要让她喝那个？
Dialogue: 1,1:18:59.57,1:19:02.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是最快的测试方法
Dialogue: 1,1:19:02.47,1:19:04.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要你不介意的话
Dialogue: 1,1:19:04.74,1:19:06.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么都愿意试
Dialogue: 1,1:19:07.94,1:19:10.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 1,1:19:10.92,1:19:13.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想我可能要吐了
Dialogue: 1,1:19:21.17,1:19:24.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样喝起来会方便些
Dialogue: 1,1:19:53.56,1:19:55.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,这味道
Dialogue: 1,1:19:58.68,1:19:59.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 1,1:20:23.19,1:20:26.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的脉搏已经变强了
Dialogue: 1,1:20:26.77,1:20:28.22,CHS,,0,0,0,,有效果了
Dialogue: 1,1:20:50.69,1:20:52.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你听起来好些了 - 是的
Dialogue: 1,1:20:52.67,1:20:53.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,我感觉好多了
Dialogue: 1,1:20:54.00,1:20:57.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,这一切一定搅乱了你们的蜜月 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:20:58.69,1:21:00.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,可以这么说
Dialogue: 1,1:21:00.58,1:21:03.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,其它方面的婚后生活你感觉还好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:21:04.45,1:21:06.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德华还是水上飘吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:21:06.76,1:21:09.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的 我是说现在的情况不同了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:09.74,1:21:13.44,CHS,,0,0,0,,重要的是你好多了 马上就要回家了 对吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:21:13.77,1:21:16.09,CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧 爸爸 我不想吓到你
Dialogue: 1,1:21:17.36,1:21:18.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,不过
Dialogue: 1,1:21:18.10,1:21:22.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要去瑞士的一个医疗中心
Dialogue: 1,1:21:22.17,1:21:25.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？你要去瑞士
Dialogue: 1,1:21:25.32,1:21:26.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你不是说你好些了吗 - 是的
Dialogue: 1,1:21:28.01,1:21:30.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 贝拉 我坐飞机来
Dialogue: 1,1:21:31.72,1:21:36.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样 真的就只是像做一次…水疗
Dialogue: 1,1:21:36.89,1:21:41.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,我肯定你来之前我就会好多了
Dialogue: 1,1:21:41.32,1:21:42.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,我…我不知道
Dialogue: 1,1:21:42.97,1:21:44.41,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸 不要来
Dialogue: 1,1:21:45.45,1:21:46.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,就当我很健康
Dialogue: 1,1:21:46.44,1:21:49.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,仿佛我和你一起坐在沙发上 吃着比萨什么的
Dialogue: 1,1:21:49.42,1:21:51.19,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要我想象？
Dialogue: 1,1:21:51.23,1:21:52.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说这管用
Dialogue: 1,1:21:53.34,1:21:55.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,就这么想象着我
Dialogue: 1,1:21:57.49,1:21:59.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,仿佛我就在那里
Dialogue: 1,1:21:59.17,1:22:01.31,CHS,,0,0,0,,这样能让我感觉舒服些
Dialogue: 1,1:22:02.62,1:22:04.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,爸 我先挂了 好吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:22:04.38,1:22:05.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:22:05.57,1:22:07.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:22:28.44,1:22:30.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起我发这么大的火
Dialogue: 1,1:22:31.87,1:22:34.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,换了我也会
Dialogue: 1,1:22:34.20,1:22:36.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,我让你一个人来承受这一切
Dialogue: 1,1:22:42.39,1:22:44.18,CHS,,0,0,0,,婚姻
Dialogue: 1,1:22:49.13,1:22:51.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说第一年是最难的
Dialogue: 1,1:22:57.19,1:22:59.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么声音？- 什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:00.01,1:23:01.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好像刚刚听到
Dialogue: 1,1:23:02.73,1:23:05.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,再说点别的什么
Dialogue: 1,1:23:06.24,1:23:06.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,比如什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:10.42,1:23:13.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德华 怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:14.21,1:23:16.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,他喜欢你的声音
Dialogue: 1,1:23:16.10,1:23:17.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你能听到他？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:18.19,1:23:20.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,想法
Dialogue: 1,1:23:22.67,1:23:24.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,他也喜欢我的声音
Dialogue: 1,1:23:25.12,1:23:26.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:26.97,1:23:28.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,你听到什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:29.62,1:23:30.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,好奇怪
Dialogue: 1,1:23:31.31,1:23:35.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我以为他像我 其实他像你
Dialogue: 1,1:23:35.27,1:23:37.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,善良 纯洁
Dialogue: 1,1:23:38.27,1:23:39.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,他很高兴
Dialogue: 1,1:23:42.22,1:23:44.32,CHS,,0,0,0,,你当然高兴
Dialogue: 1,1:23:44.88,1:23:47.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,你当然高兴 你怎么会不高兴呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:48.42,1:23:50.94,CHS,,0,0,0,,我好爱你
Dialogue: 1,1:23:52.24,1:23:54.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在你听到什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:23:54.82,1:23:57.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,他爱你 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:23:58.58,1:24:01.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪
Dialogue: 1,1:24:32.96,1:24:35.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅各布
Dialogue: 1,1:24:45.37,1:24:46.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是最后一包了吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:24:46.28,1:24:48.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉可能明天就会生产
Dialogue: 1,1:24:49.00,1:24:51.04,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果她想要任何成功的机会的话 她需要更多的血
Dialogue: 1,1:24:51.08,1:24:52.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,你需要进食
Dialogue: 1,1:24:52.89,1:24:55.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,为了她 你必须保持最佳状态 我们今晚需要走
Dialogue: 1,1:24:55.69,1:24:57.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔 你现在成了他们的敌人了
Dialogue: 1,1:24:58.22,1:25:00.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,山姆不会手软 你会被宰杀
Dialogue: 1,1:25:00.87,1:25:02.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,埃米特会和我们一起去
Dialogue: 1,1:25:02.68,1:25:05.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 那不够 - 我们没有选择 雅各布
Dialogue: 1,1:25:05.51,1:25:08.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要有办法能救她 我们都要尝试
Dialogue: 1,1:25:08.30,1:25:09.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们会为她冒生命危险吗？
Dialogue: 1,1:25:10.00,1:25:11.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们当然会
Dialogue: 1,1:25:11.64,1:25:14.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉现在已经是我们家庭的成员了
Dialogue: 1,1:25:15.39,1:25:17.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 1,1:25:17.82,1:25:19.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我看得出来
Dialogue: 1,1:25:20.79,1:25:23.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,你们确实是一家人
Dialogue: 1,1:25:26.12,1:25:28.96,CHS,,0,0,0,,就像我所出生的家庭一样强大
Dialogue: 1,1:25:31.66,1:25:33.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道我该做什么
Dialogue: 1,1:25:55.07,1:25:56.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克 他们来了
Dialogue: 1,1:25:56.83,1:25:58.90,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 我知道 - 我们应该变身 雅各布
Dialogue: 1,1:25:58.94,1:26:00.57,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们这样没法保护自己
Dialogue: 1,1:26:00.58,1:26:02.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会把我们看作威胁
Dialogue: 1,1:26:03.03,1:26:04.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要和他们谈谈
Dialogue: 1,1:26:05.19,1:26:07.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你们现身的话会更方便些
Dialogue: 1,1:26:16.62,1:26:18.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,这里不再是你的领地了
Dialogue: 1,1:26:19.20,1:26:21.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,你的新家怎么样了？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:21.15,1:26:22.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你说完了没有？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:23.81,1:26:25.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,你要回家吗 杰克？
Dialogue: 1,1:26:26.16,1:26:27.80,CHS,,0,0,0,,等我了结这个
Dialogue: 1,1:26:27.94,1:26:28.67,CHS,,0,0,0,,你什么意思
Dialogue: 1,1:26:28.97,1:26:31.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要山姆把莉娅和塞斯带回去
Dialogue: 1,1:26:31.59,1:26:33.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 没门
Dialogue: 1,1:26:33.15,1:26:34.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,安静点
Dialogue: 1,1:26:36.94,1:26:40.47,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要他们安全 我也要此事结束
Dialogue: 1,1:26:51.18,1:26:54.86,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要山姆等到贝拉摆脱这个孽障时
Dialogue: 1,1:26:54.90,1:26:57.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 你是说等她死后？- 放轻松 保罗
Dialogue: 1,1:26:58.78,1:27:00.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,然后怎样？
Dialogue: 1,1:27:00.16,1:27:02.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉山姆到那时候
Dialogue: 1,1:27:03.13,1:27:05.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,我会亲手消灭那东西
Dialogue: 1,1:27:05.23,1:27:06.23,CHS,,0,0,0,,杰克
Dialogue: 1,1:27:06.98,1:27:08.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,只有我能做到
Dialogue: 1,1:27:09.13,1:27:12.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们信任我
Dialogue: 1,1:28:09.12,1:28:10.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,你耍了我们
Dialogue: 1,1:28:31.42,1:28:33.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 1,1:28:34.37,1:28:36.60,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们都好吧？- 是的
Dialogue: 1,1:28:36.64,1:28:37.35,CHS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 1,1:28:46.20,1:28:48.50,CHS,,0,0,0,,嘿
Dialogue: 1,1:28:50.53,1:28:51.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,你还好吧？
Dialogue: 1,1:28:51.86,1:28:54.30,CHS,,0,0,0,,好啊 又不是我怀着一个恶魔
Dialogue: 1,1:28:55.02,1:28:57.95,CHS,,0,0,0,,这很重要 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:28:57.97,1:28:59.79,CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉雅各布你的决定呢？
Dialogue: 1,1:29:01.05,1:29:02.54,CHS,,0,0,0,,现在又怎么了？
Dialogue: 1,1:29:03.06,1:29:05.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,露丝想要说服贝拉放弃她给孩子取的名字
Dialogue: 1,1:29:06.47,1:29:07.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,她不喜欢
Dialogue: 1,1:29:07.62,1:29:10.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,不管你选什么我都支持你
Dialogue: 1,1:29:11.29,1:29:12.59,CHS,,0,0,0,,我取的名字没那么糟糕
Dialogue: 1,1:29:12.62,1:29:14.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果是男孩 就叫E.J.
Dialogue: 1,1:29:16.00,1:29:17.71,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德华 雅各布
Dialogue: 1,1:29:19.97,1:29:22.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,行 这名字还不赖
Dialogue: 1,1:29:23.25,1:29:25.49,CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不告诉他女孩的名字？
Dialogue: 1,1:29:27.67,1:29:29.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想结合我们妈妈的名字
Dialogue: 1,1:29:30.57,1:29:32.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,蕾妮和埃斯米
Dialogue: 1,1:29:32.17,1:29:36.84,CHS,,0,0,0,,我想给她取名 莱妮斯米
Dialogue: 1,1:29:40.82,1:29:42.51,CHS,,0,0,0,,叫莱妮斯米？
Dialogue: 1,1:29:45.70,1:29:47.38,CHS,,0,0,0,,太怪了？
Dialogue: 1,1:29:49.27,1:29:50.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,不是很怪
Dialogue: 1,1:29:52.27,1:29:54.74,CHS,,0,0,0,,很美
Dialogue: 1,1:29:54.77,1:29:56.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,也很特别
Dialogue: 1,1:29:56.97,1:29:58.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,也很符合情况
Dialogue: 1,1:30:00.92,1:30:02.75,CHS,,0,0,0,,我喜欢莱妮斯米
Dialogue: 1,1:30:07.07,1:30:09.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,他喜欢
Dialogue: 1,1:30:31.07,1:30:33.13,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗莎莉 把吗啡递过来
Dialogue: 1,1:30:34.22,1:30:38.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,卡莱尔说胎盘一定已经脱落
Dialogue: 1,1:30:39.59,1:30:42.36,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他会尽快赶过来 - 我们必须动手了
Dialogue: 1,1:30:45.53,1:30:48.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,露丝 让吗啡先扩散
Dialogue: 1,1:30:48.53,1:30:51.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,没时间了 孩子会死的
Dialogue: 1,1:30:51.16,1:30:52.21,CHS,,0,0,0,,快把他取出来
Dialogue: 1,1:30:53.76,1:30:54.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,看着我 贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:31:03.56,1:31:05.83,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗莎莉 不要
Dialogue: 1,1:31:07.11,1:31:07.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝 带她出去
Dialogue: 1,1:31:07.78,1:31:10.91,CHS,,0,0,0,,罗莎莉
Dialogue: 1,1:31:12.71,1:31:15.56,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 救救她 你得转化她的 - 不行 孩子还在里面
Dialogue: 1,1:31:15.89,1:31:16.92,CHS,,0,0,0,,我要先把孩子弄出来
Dialogue: 1,1:31:19.15,1:31:22.06,CHS,,0,0,0,,集中精神 保持心跳
Dialogue: 1,1:31:22.13,1:31:23.29,CHS,,0,0,0,,他窒息了
Dialogue: 1,1:32:03.53,1:32:06.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,是莱妮斯米
Dialogue: 1,1:32:08.07,1:32:15.88,CHS,,0,0,0,,你真美
Dialogue: 1,1:32:54.60,1:32:55.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:32:56.59,1:32:57.25,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:32:59.51,1:33:00.15,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉
Dialogue: 1,1:33:07.66,1:33:09.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅各布 抱着孩子
Dialogue: 1,1:33:09.15,1:33:10.70,CHS,,0,0,0,,别让它靠近我
Dialogue: 1,1:33:11.14,1:33:12.39,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱德华
Dialogue: 1,1:33:13.01,1:33:14.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,我来照顾她
Dialogue: 1,1:33:15.27,1:33:17.16,CHS,,0,0,0,,我发誓我没问题 让我来吧
Dialogue: 1,1:33:26.14,1:33:27.08,CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:33:31.59,1:33:32.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我的毒液
Dialogue: 1,1:34:00.04,1:34:01.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,应该有用的
Dialogue: 1,1:34:14.83,1:34:16.77,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会杀你
Dialogue: 1,1:34:17.34,1:34:18.28,CHS,,0,0,0,,那样就便宜了你
Dialogue: 1,1:34:18.31,1:34:22.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,你该活着承受这一切
Dialogue: 1,1:34:57.30,1:35:00.24,CHS,,0,0,0,,她没挺过来
Dialogue: 1,1:35:13.51,1:35:15.76,CHS,,0,0,0,,我没死 你也没有死
Dialogue: 1,1:35:17.47,1:35:17.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,快呀
Dialogue: 1,1:35:20.46,1:35:21.12,CHS,,0,0,0,,快呀
Dialogue: 1,1:35:28.60,1:35:30.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,不 会有用的
Dialogue: 1,1:35:33.03,1:35:34.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,求你了
Dialogue: 1,1:36:20.71,1:36:21.69,CHS,,0,0,0,,快醒过来
Dialogue: 1,1:36:24.19,1:36:25.52,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉 求你了
Dialogue: 1,1:36:56.72,1:36:57.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管他做了什么
Dialogue: 1,1:36:59.35,1:37:00.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,他始终是我儿子
Dialogue: 1,1:37:00.75,1:37:01.53,CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起 比利
Dialogue: 1,1:37:03.20,1:37:05.00,CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是觉得你该知道
Dialogue: 1,1:37:10.57,1:37:11.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,贝拉死了
Dialogue: 1,1:37:13.12,1:37:14.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,那东西害死了她
Dialogue: 1,1:37:16.87,1:37:19.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们走
Dialogue: 1,1:38:07.17,1:38:11.17,CHS,,0,0,0,,像是不可抗拒的力量
Dialogue: 1,1:38:11.89,1:38:14.05,CHS,,0,0,0,,是你的世界为之改变
Dialogue: 1,1:38:16.66,1:38:19.78,CHS,,0,0,0,,突然之间 支撑你的不再是这个世界
Dialogue: 1,1:38:20.82,1:38:22.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,你愿意做任何事情
Dialogue: 1,1:38:23.07,1:38:25.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要她需要
Dialogue: 1,1:38:27.57,1:38:29.26,CHS,,0,0,0,,朋友
Dialogue: 1,1:38:30.57,1:38:31.55,CHS,,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 1,1:38:33.07,1:38:34.27,CHS,,0,0,0,,保护者
Dialogue: 1,1:38:55.06,1:38:57.34,CHS,,0,0,0,,爱丽丝
Dialogue: 1,1:39:02.34,1:39:04.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,你会没事的
Dialogue: 1,1:39:18.67,1:39:20.10,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 他们人多 - 差距悬殊
Dialogue: 1,1:39:20.14,1:39:22.01,CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会让他们伤害我的家人
Dialogue: 1,1:40:38.87,1:40:41.87,CHS,,0,0,0,,住手 结束了
Dialogue: 1,1:40:43.20,1:40:44.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,如果你要杀她 就先杀我
Dialogue: 1,1:40:59.07,1:41:00.40,CHS,,0,0,0,,雅各布将她铭记了
Dialogue: 1,1:41:06.17,1:41:07.37,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不会伤害她的
Dialogue: 1,1:41:09.07,1:41:12.14,CHS,,0,0,0,,只要被狼人铭记着 就不会受到伤害
Dialogue: 1,1:41:17.07,1:41:19.11,CHS,,0,0,0,,这是他们的不可抗拒的规矩
Dialogue: 1,1:41:54.07,1:41:55.68,CHS,,0,0,0,,她不应该毫无反应
Dialogue: 1,1:41:58.11,1:41:59.93,CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗啡的原因
Dialogue: 1,1:42:01.23,1:42:03.98,CHS,,0,0,0,,- 也许是太晚了 - 不 爱德华
Dialogue: 1,1:42:04.16,1:42:05.20,CHS,,0,0,0,,听她的心跳
Dialogue: 1,1:47:27.26,1:47:29.48,CHS,,0,0,0,,是卡莱尔寄来的
Dialogue: 1,1:47:30.87,1:47:35.61,CHS,,0,0,0,,拼写里应该带有一个S 亲爱的比安卡
Dialogue: 1,1:47:41.81,1:47:46.07,CHS,,0,0,0,,他家又添丁了
Dialogue: 1,1:47:46.87,1:47:48.72,CHS,,0,0,0,,他的势力提升了
Dialogue: 1,1:47:57.47,1:48:01.62,CHS,,0,0,0,,首先是拼写和语法的问题
Dialogue: 1,1:48:04.90,1:48:09.81,CHS,,0,0,0,,至少我们与卡伦一家的争端已经结束
Dialogue: 1,1:48:10.63,1:48:11.65,CHS,,0,0,0,,结束？
Dialogue: 1,1:48:12.56,1:48:13.82,CHS,,0,0,0,,天哪 不…
Dialogue: 1,1:48:15.17,1:48:20.03,CHS,,0,0,0,,我们的争议远非一个凡人的命运
Dialogue: 1,1:48:21.15,1:48:22.97,CHS,,0,0,0,,会是什么？
Dialogue: 1,1:48:23.18,1:48:25.99,CHS,,0,0,0,,我还以为你明白
Dialogue: 1,1:48:27.94,1:48:29.58,CHS,,0,0,0,,他们有我想要的东西
